    ["Bring 1 Qiraji Regal Drape, 2 Obsidian Idols, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. You must also obtain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest."] = "将1件其拉帝王披风、2个黑曜石雕像、5个黄金甲虫和5个陶土甲虫交给凯伊·迅爪。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到崇敬声望才能完成这个任务。",
    ["Bring 1 Qiraji Regal Drape, 2 Vermillion Idols, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Keyl Swiftclaw in Silithus. You must also obtain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest."] = "将1件其拉帝王披风、2个朱红雕像、5个银质甲虫和5个白骨甲虫交给凯伊·迅爪。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到崇敬声望才能完成这个任务。",
    ["Bring 1 Qiraji Spiked Hilt, 2 Amber Idols, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Warden Haro in Silithus. You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest."] = "将1件其拉尖刺护裙、2个琥珀雕像、5个青铜甲虫和5个象牙甲虫交给安其拉甲虫之墙后的守望者哈尔洛。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到崇拜声望才能完成这个任务。",
    ["Bring 1 Qiraji Spiked Hilt, 2 Azure Idols, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Warden Haro in Silithus. You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to complete this quest."] = "将1件其拉尖刺护裙、2个碧蓝雕像、5个银质甲虫和5个白骨甲虫交给安其拉甲虫之墙后的守望者哈尔洛。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到崇拜声望才能完成这个任务。",
    ["Bring 10 Barbecued Buzzard Wings and 5 bottles of Junglevine Wine to Captain Smotts' Lifeboat.Kill Negolash, and bring Smotts' Cutlass to Captain Smotts in Stranglethorn."] = "将10块烧烤秃鹰翅膀和5瓶密林葡萄酒带到斯莫特船长的救生艇上去。  然后杀死奈古拉什，将斯莫特的弯刀交给荆棘谷的斯莫特船长。",
    ["Bring 10 Bundles of Akiris Reed to Privateer Bloads in Booty Bay."] = "给藏宝海湾的海盗布劳兹带回10根海蛇草。",
    ["Bring 10 Filled Pure Sample Jars to Laris Geardawdle in Ironforge.If you have trouble finding them, perhaps try to get more clues from Laris."] = "将10个纯净样本瓶交给铁炉堡的拉里斯·空轮。  如果你无法找到它们的话，不妨到拉里斯那里去再打听一些线索。",
    ["Bring 10 Highperch Venom Sacs to Fiora Longears in Theramore."] = "收集10个风巢双足飞龙的毒囊，把它们带给塞拉摩的菲欧拉·长耳。",
    ["Bring 10 Monstrous Crawler Legs to Dar in the Swamp of Sorrows."] = "给悲伤沼泽的达尔带去10条巨大的螃蟹腿。",
    ["Bring 10 Morrowgrain to Quintis Jonespyre in Feathermoon Stronghold."] = "将10株晨光麦交给羽月要塞的奎恩提斯。",
    ["Bring 10 Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Pratt McGrubben at Feathermoon Stronghold, Feralas."] = "把10块怒痕雪人的毛皮交给菲拉斯羽月要塞的普拉特·马克格鲁比。",
    ["Bring 10 Scarlet Insignia Rings to Deathguard Burgess in Brill."] = "给布瑞尔的亡灵卫兵伯吉斯带回10枚血色十字军徽记之戒。",
    ["Bring 10 Singing Blue Crystals to Crank Fizzlebub in Booty Bay."] = "给藏宝海湾的克兰克·菲兹巴布带回10块蓝色歌唱水晶。",
    ["Bring 10 Thick Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache."] = "给莫沙彻营地的杉多尔·迅蹄带去十张厚重的雪人皮。",
    ["Bring 10 Twilight Pendants to Argent Guard Manados in Darnassus."] = "收集10个暮光坠饰，把它们交给达纳苏斯的银月守卫玛纳杜斯。",
    ["Bring 10 Webwood Venom Sacs to Gilshalan Windwalker at Aldrassil."] = "给奥达希尔的基尔沙兰·风行者带回10个树林蜘蛛的毒囊。",
    ["Bring 10 vials of Mountain Lion Blood to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill."] = "收集10瓶山地狮的血液，把它们交给塔伦米尔的药剂师林度恩。",
    ["Bring 12 Red Burlap Bandanas to Deputy Willem outside the Northshire Abbey."] = "给北郡的维里副队长带回12个红色粗麻面罩。",
    ["Bring 12 Silithid Eggs and the Digging Claw to Korran at the Crossroads."] = "把12枚异种蝎卵和掘地爪交给十字路口的科兰。",
    ["Bring 12 Timberling Sprouts to Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth."] = "给奥拉密斯湖边的德纳兰带去12个林精的新芽。",
    ["Bring 12 Tunnel Rat Ears to Mountaineer Kadrell in Thelsamar."] = "收集12只坑道鼠的耳朵，把它们带给塞尔萨玛的巡山人卡德雷尔。",
    ["Bring 12 pieces of Light Leather to Veren Tallstrider in Thunder Bluff."] = "收集12块轻皮，把它们交给雷霆崖的维尔伦·陆行者。",
    ["Bring 12 samples of Zanzil's Mixture to Crank Fizzlebub in Booty Bay."] = "收集12份赞吉尔的药剂，把它们交给藏宝海湾的克兰克·菲兹巴布。",
    ["Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 17 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Remulos to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Revered reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest."] = "把15枚作战徽章、20枚后勤徽章、17枚战术徽章和1枚雷姆洛斯印记交给塞纳里奥要塞的瓦古斯。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到崇敬声望才能完成这个任务。",
    ["Bring 15 Cenarion Combat Badges, 20 Cenarion Logistics Badges, 20 Cenarion Tactical Badges and 1 Mark of Cenarius to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Exalted reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest."] = "把15枚作战徽章、20枚后勤徽章、20枚战术徽章和1枚塞纳留斯印记交给塞纳里奥要塞的瓦古斯。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到崇拜声望才能完成这个任务。",
    ["Bring 15 Centaur Bracers to Regthar Deathgate, west of the Crossroads."] = "收集15个半人马护腕，把他们交给十字路口的雷戈萨·死门。",
    ["Bring 15 Centaur Ears to Corporal Melkins at Nijel's Point in Desolace."] = "收集15个半人马耳朵，把它们交给尼耶尔前哨站的麦尔金斯下士。",
    ["Bring 15 Red Leather Bandanas to Scout Galiaan at Sentinel Hill."] = "给哨兵岭的哨兵加里安带回15条红色皮质面罩。",
    ["Bring 20 Shrunken Heads to Nimboya at the Grom'gol Base Camp."] = "给格罗姆高营地的尼姆布亚带去20个皱缩的头颅。",
    ["Bring 25 Split Bone Necklaces to Kin'weelay at the Grom'gol Base camp."] = "给格罗姆高营地的肯维雷带回25串裂骨项链。",
    ["Bring 30 Runecloth to Meilosh in Timbermaw Hold."] = "把30块符文布交给木喉要塞的梅罗什。",
    ["Bring 5 Cenarion Combat Badges, 3 Cenarion Logistics Badges and 7 Cenarion Tactical Badges to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus. You must also attain Friendly reputation with Cenarion Circle to be able to complete this quest."] = "把5枚作战徽章、3枚后勤徽章和7枚战术徽章交给塞纳里奥要塞的瓦古斯。你必须在塞纳里奥议会中达到友善声望才能完成这个任务。",
    ["Bring 5 Charged Thunder Lizard Organs to Rezlak near Drygulch Ravine."] = "把5个带电的雷霆蜥蜴器官带给枯水谷附近的雷兹拉克。",
    ["Bring 5 Iron Pikes and 5 Iron Rivets to Foreman Oslow in Lakeshire."] = "给湖畔镇的工头奥斯洛带回5根铁矛和5个铁铆钉。",
    ["Bring 5 Mossy Tumors to Rellian Greenspyre in Darnassus."] = "收集5个青苔之瘤，然后把它们交给达纳苏斯的雷利亚·绿树。",
    ["Bring 5 Scaber Stalks and 1 Death Cap to Barithras Moonshade in Auberdine."] = "收集5个粗柄蘑菇和1个毒帽蘑菇，把它们交给奥伯丁的巴瑞萨斯·月影。",
    ["Bring 5 twitching antennae to Ruga Ragetotem at Camp Taurajo."] = "收集5根颤抖的触角，把它们带给贫瘠之地陶拉祖营地的鲁迦。",
    ["Bring 6 Mathystra Relics to Onu at the Grove of the Ancients."] = "收集6个黑暗深渊遗物，把它们交给古树之林的安努。",
    ["Bring 6 Red Linen Bandanas to Sara Timberlain at the Eastvale Logging Camp."] = "给东谷伐木场的萨拉·迪博雷恩带去6块红色亚麻布面罩。",
    ["Bring 6 Shimmerweeds to Rejold Barleybrew in the Brewnall Village."] = "收集6束微光草，把它们交给烈酒村的雷杰德·麦酒。",
