    ["Bring the following Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub to Falthir the Sightless: A Primal Hakkari Aegis. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Revered with the Zandalar Tribe.Falthir the Sightless is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale."] = "从祖尔格拉布把以下权力珍宝带给盲眼法希尔：1块原始哈卡莱盾牌。你还必须在赞达拉部族中达到崇敬或更高的声望。  盲眼法希尔在荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛上。",
    ["Bring the following Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub to Falthir the Sightless: A Primal Hakkari Bindings. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Friendly with the Zandalar Tribe.Falthir the Sightless is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale."] = "从祖尔格拉布把以下权力珍宝带给盲眼法希尔克：1条原始哈卡莱护腕。你还必须在赞达拉部族中达到友善或更高的声望。  盲眼法希尔克在荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛上。",
    ["Bring the following Paragons of Power from Zul'Gurub to Falthir the Sightless: A Primal Hakkari Shawl. You must also have a reputation equal to or greater than Honored with the Zandalar Tribe.Falthir the Sightless is located on Yojamba Isle, Stranglethorn Vale."] = "从祖尔格拉布把以下权力珍宝带给盲眼法希尔：1条原始哈卡莱披肩。你还必须在赞达拉部族中达到尊敬或更高的声望。  盲眼法希尔在荆棘谷的尤亚姆巴岛上。",
    ["Bring the head of Chief Sharptusk Thornmantle to Brave Windfeather in Red Cloud Mesa."] = "把刺鬃酋长的头颅交给红云台地的卫兵维萨罗·风羽。",
    ["Bring the head of Targorr the Dread to Guard Berton in Lakeshire."] = "把塔格尔的头颅带给湖畔镇的卫兵伯尔顿。",
    ["Bring the the Carapace of the Old God, 2 Idols of Life, 5 Gold Scarabs and 5 Clay Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest."] = "把上古之神的外鞘、2个生命塑像、5个黄金甲虫和5个陶土甲虫交给安其拉的温瑟拉。你必须在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到尊敬声望才能完成这个任务。",
    ["Bring the the Carapace of the Old God, 2 Idols of War, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest."] = "把上古之神的外鞘、2个战争塑像、5个银质甲虫和5个白骨甲虫交给安其拉的温瑟拉。你必须在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到尊敬声望才能完成这个任务。",
    ["Bring the the Carapace of the Old God, 2 Idols of the Sage, 5 Silver Scarabs and 5 Bone Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest."] = "把上古之神的外鞘、2个先知塑像、5个银质甲虫和5个白骨甲虫交给安其拉的温瑟拉。你必须在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到尊敬声望才能完成这个任务。",
    ["Bring the the Husk of the Old God, 2 Idols of Death, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest."] = "把上古之神的外鞘、2个死亡塑像、5个岩石甲虫和5个水晶甲虫交给安其拉的温瑟拉。你必须在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到尊敬声望才能完成这个任务。",
    ["Bring the the Husk of the Old God, 2 Idols of Night, 5 Stone Scarabs and 5 Crystal Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest."] = "把上古之神的外鞘、2个夜晚塑像、5个岩石甲虫和5个水晶甲虫交给安其拉的温瑟拉。你必须在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到尊敬声望才能完成这个任务。",
    ["Bring the the Husk of the Old God, 2 Idols of Rebirth, 5 Bronze Scarabs and 5 Ivory Scarabs to Vethsera inside Ahn'Qiraj. You must also attain Honored reputation with the Brood of Nozdormu to complete this quest."] = "把上古之神的外鞘、2个重生塑像、5个青铜甲虫和5个象牙甲虫交给安其拉的温瑟拉。你必须在诺兹多姆的子嗣中达到尊敬声望才能完成这个任务。",
    ["Bring twenty-four Robo-mechanical Guts to Shoni in Stormwind."] = "收集24副机械内胆，把它们交给暴风城的舒尼。",
    ["Buy or catch a Raw Brilliant Smallfish, then use the Knife Set to fillet it in front of Boarton Shadetotem in Thunder Bluff."] = "购买或捕捉一条新鲜的闪亮小鱼，在雷霆崖的巴通·阴影图腾面前使用一套匕首将其大卸八块。",
    ["Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff wants you to bring him the Horn of Arra'chea."] = "雷霆崖的凯恩·血蹄要你将阿兰其亚的角带给他。",
    ["Captain Steelgut in Faldir's Cove wants you to kill 10 Daggerspine Raiders and 3 Daggerspine Sorceresses."] = "法迪尔海湾的斯迪加特船长要你去杀掉10个刺脊袭击者和3个刺脊巫师。",
    ["Captain Thalo'thas Brightsun of Ratchet wants you to collect 10 Theramore Medals and slay Captain Fairmount, Cannoneer Whessan and Cannoneer Smythe."] = "棘齿城中的沙罗萨斯船长要你收集10枚塞拉摩徽章并干掉法莫斯队长、炮兵维桑恩和炮兵斯密瑟。",
    ["Claim your reward from Hydraxis' Coffer."] = "从海达克西斯的箱子拿取你的奖励。",
    ["Collect 10 Bloodied Insignias and take them to General Marcus Jonathan in Stormwind City."] = "收集10枚血污徽章，并把它们交给暴风城的马库斯·乔纳森将军。",
    ["Collect 10 Water Elemental Cores from the Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays along the Forgotten Coast of Feralas, and bring them back to Zorbin Fandazzle who is near the dock there."] = "从菲拉斯被遗忘的海岸那里的海元素和巨型海元素身上获取10块水元素核心，把它们交给码头附近的索尔宾·范达瑟。",
    ["Collect 12 pieces of Sturdy Lumber from Shadowvale in Tirisfal Glades."] = "从提瑞斯法林地的影谷收集12块坚固的木材。",
    ["Collect 25 Intact Limbs within The Ruins of Lordaeron for Morbin Lightbane in the Undercity."] = "在洛丹伦废墟收集25个完好的肢体，交给幽暗城的莫宾·圣光之灾。",
    ["Collect 25 Ogre Warbeads from Ogres inside Dire Maul or Blackrock Spire and return to Falrin Treeshaper inside the Athenaeum in Dire Maul."] = "在厄运之槌和黑石塔的食人魔身上收集25串食人魔珠串，然后回去向厄运之槌图书馆内的法尔林·树影复命。",
    ["Collect 25 Theradric Crystal Carvings for Willow in Desolace."] = "为凄凉之地的维洛收集25个瑟莱德丝水晶雕像。",
    ["Collect 5 Prospector's Picks.At a forge, smash the Prospector's Picks to create Broken Tools.Bring 5 Broken Tools to Baine Bloodhoof in Bloodhoof Village."] = "收集5个勘察员的锄头。  在铁匠铺砸碎这些勘察员的锄头。  把5件损坏的工具交给血蹄村的贝恩·血蹄。",
    ["Collect 6 Azure Feathers and 6 Bronze Feathers, and bring them to Eyahn Eagletalon in Thunder Bluff."] = "收集6根碧蓝色的羽毛和6根古铜色的羽毛，把它们交给雷霆崖的伊恩·鹰爪。",
    ["Collect 6 Fine Crab Chunks for Gubber Blump in Auberdine."] = "收集6块优质蟹肉，把它们交给奥伯丁的古博·布拉普。",
    ["Collect 6 Giant Crocolisk Skins and bring them to James Halloran in Menethil Harbor."] = "为米奈希尔港的詹姆斯·哈洛兰带回6张巨型鳄鱼的皮。",
    ["Collect 6 Scrawny Ursera Claws from Scrawny Ursera in Thendal Grove."] = "从森达尔林地瘦弱的乌萨拉身上收集6只瘦弱的乌萨拉之爪。",
    ["Collect 7 Hyacinth Mushrooms, 4 Moonpetal Lilies, and 1 Webwood Ichor for Dirania Silveshine in Shadowglen."] = "在幽影谷中为迪兰妮亚·月光收集7朵紫蓝色蘑菇、4朵月牙百合花和一份树林蜘蛛的脓液。",
    ["Collect 8 Fel Moss and bring them to Tarindrella."] = "收集8块魔苔，把它们交给塔琳德拉。",
    ["Collect 8 Webbed Diemetradon Scales and 8 Webbed Pterrordax Scales for Shizzle in Marshal's Refuge."] = "为马绍尔营地的希兹尔收集8块精细的双帆龙鳞片和8块精细的翼手龙鳞片。",
    ["Collect ingredients for murloc bait."] = "收集6瓶动物血液和18份暮草花瓣以制作鱼人诱饵，然后向闪金镇的雷米复命。",
    ["Collect the Highly Toxic Strain from Witherfang in Ruins of Lordaeron for Theodore Griffs in Undercity."] = "前往洛丹伦废墟，从枯牙身上提取剧毒的毒株，将其交给幽暗城的萨多雷·格雷夫。",
    ["Collect the Warsong Supplies: Warsong Saw Blades, Logging Rope, Warsong Oil, and the Warsong Axe Shipment for Locke Okarr in Splintertree Post."] = "收集战歌氏族的补给品：战歌锯条、伐木绳、战歌之油，还有一箱战歌之斧。",
    ["Collect the missing pages from The Green Hills of Stranglethorn manuscript. Once all four chapters are complete, return them to Barnil."] = "收集《荆棘谷的青山》的手稿中丢失的页面。在集齐四章书之后，将它们还给巴尼尔·石罐。",
    ["Commander Aggro'gosh of the Grom'gol base camp wants you to kill 10 Ogre Brutes and 5 Ogre Witch Doctors."] = "格罗姆高营地的指挥官阿格罗戈什要求你杀死10个食人魔蛮兵和5个食人魔巫医。",
    ["Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Redemption Boots if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1双被玷污的长靴，12块板甲碎片，2块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一双救赎长靴。",
    ["Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Redemption Handguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的护手，8块板甲碎片，1块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一副救赎护手。",
    ["Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Redemption Wristguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 2 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的护腕，6块板甲碎片，1块奥金锭和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一副救赎护腕。",
    ["Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Redemption Girdle if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1条被玷污的束带，8块板甲碎片，1块奥金锭和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一条救赎束带。",
    ["Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Redemption Headpiece if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 5 Arcanite Bars and 2 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1件被玷污的头饰，15块板甲碎片，5块奥金锭和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一件救赎头饰。",
    ["Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Redemption Tunic if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1件被玷污的外套，25块板甲碎片，4块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一件救赎外套。",
    ["Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a pair of Redemption Legguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Legguards, 20 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的腿甲，20块板甲碎片，4块奥金锭和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一副救赎腿甲。",
    ["Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a pair of Redemption Spaulders if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Spaulders, 12 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的肩铠，12块板甲碎片，2块奥金锭和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的指挥官埃里戈尔·黎明使者，他将为你制作一副救赎肩铠。",
    ["Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus wants you to find his beloved Natalia. The information that you gathered points to Hive'Regal in the south as being the area in which you may find Mistress Natalia Mar'alith.Do not forget to visit the dwarves at Bronzebeard's camp before venturing into the hive. They might have some additional work and advice for you.And &lt;name&gt;, remember the Commander's words: \"Do what you must...\"."] = "希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的指挥官玛尔利斯想要你找到他心爱的纳塔莉亚。你收集到的信息表明纳塔莉亚·玛尔利斯可能在南面的雷戈虫巢。  在你赶往虫巢之前，记得去铜须营地拜访一下那儿的矮人，他们或许会给你提些建议。  <name>，记住指挥官的话：做你应该做的……",
    ["Confront Belthaan Brightwish along the road to the Shrine of Akir."] = "在前往阿基尔神殿的路上与贝拉萨恩·明愿对峙。",
    ["Consume the Water of the Seers in front of the tribal fire in Bloodhoof Village and follow the vision once it appears. Provided item:."] = "在血蹄村的部族之火前将先知之水喝下，当幻象出现之后跟随它。",
    ["Councilman Millstipe of Darkshire wants you to bring him the hand of Dextren Ward."] = "夜色镇的米尔斯迪普议员要你杀死迪克斯特·瓦德，并把他的手带回来作为证明。",
    ["Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 4 Frozen Runes, 12 Enchanted Leather, 3 Essence of Water, 3 Cured Rugged Hides and 200 gold."] = "将4个冰冻符文、12个魔化皮、3个水之精华、3个熟化毛皮和200金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的工匠威尔海姆。",
    ["Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 4 Frozen Runes, 12 Thorium Bars, 2 Arcanite Bars, 2 Essence of Water and 200 gold."] = "将4个冰冻符文、12块瑟银锭、2块奥金锭、2个水之精华和200金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的工匠威尔海姆。",
    ["Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 4 Frozen Runes, 2 Bolts of Runecloth, 2 Essences of Water, 2 Ironweb Spider Silks and 200 gold."] = "将4个冰冻符文、2个符文布卷、2个水之精华、2个铁网蛛丝和200金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的工匠威尔海姆。",
    ["Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Frozen Runes, 12 Enchanted Leather, 3 Essence of Water, 3 Cured Rugged Hides and 200 gold."] = "将5个冰冻符文、12个魔化皮、3个水之精华、3个熟化毛皮和200金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的工匠威尔海姆。",
    ["Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Frozen Runes, 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 2 Essences of Water, 4 Ironweb Spider Silks and 200 gold. You must also be of Exalted reputation with the Argent Dawn."] = "将5个冰冻符文、4个符文布卷、2个水之精华、4个铁网蛛丝和200金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的工匠威尔海姆。你在银色黎明的声望必须达到崇拜。",
    ["Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Frozen Runes, 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 4 Essences of Water, 2 Ironweb Spider Silks and 200 gold."] = "将5个冰冻符文、4个符文布卷、4个水之精华、2个铁网蛛丝和200金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的工匠威尔海姆。",
    ["Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 8 Frozen Runes, 16 Enchanted Leathers, 5 Essences of Water, 5 Cured Rugged Hides and 300 gold. You must also be of Exalted reputation with the Argent Dawn."] = "将8个冰冻符文、16个魔化皮、5个水之精华、5个熟化毛皮和300金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的工匠威尔海姆。你在银色黎明的声望必须达到崇拜。",
    ["Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants you to bring him 2 Frozen Runes, 2 Essence of Water, 2 Blue Sapphires and 30 gold pieces."] = "将2个冰冻符文、2个水之精华、2块蓝宝石和30金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的工匠威尔海姆。",
    ["Darren Malvew of Southshore wants you to kill 8 Mountain Lions and 10 Hulking Mountain Lions."] = "南海镇的达伦·玛尔维要你杀掉8只山地狮和10只巨型山地狮。",
    ["Deathguard Samsa of Tarren Mill wants 30 Hillsbrad Human Skulls."] = "塔伦米尔的亡灵卫兵沙穆萨想要30个希尔斯布莱德人类颅骨。",
    ["Deep within the Slag Pit of the Cauldron, in the Searing Gorge, you will find the traitorous Dark Iron dwarf named Overseer Maltorius.Slay Overseer Maltorius and take his head. Return the head to Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker in the Searing Gorge for your reward."] = "那个叫做工头玛托留斯的黑铁矮人叛徒就藏在大熔炉的熔渣之池深处。  杀死工头玛托留斯，将他的头颅交给灼热峡谷的侦查队长洛洛尔以换取你的奖励。",
    ["Defeat Chakuyak and bring back her pelt."] = "击败查库亚克，并带回她的毛皮。",
    ["Defeat Mok'Morokk and report the news to Draz'Zilb in Brackenwall Village."] = "打败莫格穆洛克，再把消息带给蕨墙村的德拉兹辛比。",
    ["Defeat Morganth.Bring his Pendant of Shadow to Theocritus at the Tower of Azora in Elwynn Forest."] = "击败莫甘斯。  将他的阴影坠饰带给塞欧克瑞图斯，他就在艾尔文森林内的阿祖拉之塔中。",
    ["Defeat Zalazane.Kill 8 Voodoo Trolls and 8 Hexed Trolls.Bring Zalazane's Head to Gadrin."] = "打败扎拉赞恩。  杀死8个巫毒巨魔和8个妖术巨魔。  把扎拉赞恩的头颅带给加德林大师。",
    ["Defend Daphne Stilwell from the Defias attack.Neither of your spirits must be released from their mortal coils if you wish to succeed.After you are successful, speak to Daphne Stilwell again."] = "在迪菲亚兄弟会进攻时保护达芙妮·斯迪威尔的安全。  如果你想成功的话，你和达芙妮都不能死在他们的剑下。",
    ["Defend Nighthaven from Eranikus. Do not let Keeper Remulos perish. Do not slay Eranikus. Defend yourself. Await Tyrande."] = "保护永夜港免受伊兰尼库斯的伤害。不要让守护者雷姆洛斯死亡。不要杀掉伊兰尼库斯。保护好你们自己。等待泰兰德。",
    ["Deliver Baros Alexston's report on the Defias Brotherhood to King Varian Wrynn in Stormwind Keep."] = "将有关迪菲亚兄弟会的报告送给暴风要塞里的国王瓦里安·乌瑞恩。",
    ["Deliver Trol'kalar to Zengu in Hammerfall."] = "把托卡拉尔剑交给落锤村的森古。",
    ["Deliver the Camp Mojache Zukk'ash Report to Zilzibin Drumlore. He resides in the Drag of Orgrimmar."] = "把莫沙彻营地祖卡什报告交给奥格瑞玛暗巷区的基尔兹宾·鼓眼。",
    ["Deliver the Crystal of Zin-Malor to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus."] = "将辛玛洛水晶送到达纳苏斯的大德鲁伊范达尔·鹿盔那里。",
    ["Deliver the Head of Ossirian the Unscarred to Commander Mar'alith at Cenarion Hold in Silithus."] = "将无疤者奥斯里安的头颅交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的指挥官玛尔利斯。",
    ["Deliver the Mysterious Relic to Vestia Moonspear in Feathermoon Stronghold."] = "将神秘遗物交给羽月要塞的维斯提亚·月矛。",
    ["Deliver the Sealed Letter to Glix Xizzix in the Undercity."] = "将密封的信函交给幽暗城的格利克斯·希基克斯。",
    ["Deliver the glowing crystal to Talanaanis Shadowsong in Valanaar."] = "将发光的水晶交给瓦拉纳尔的塔拉尼斯·影歌。",
    ["Denalan at Lake Al'Ameth wants you to collect the Gargantuan Tumor from Oakenscowl."] = "奥拉密斯湖的德纳兰要你去拿到奥肯斯古尔身上的巨大的瘤。",
    ["Destroy 10 Wind Hollows in Shadowgale Forest."] = "在影风森林消灭10个空洞风灵。",
    ["Destroy Razelikh the Defiler and return the Severed Horn of the Defiler to the Fallen Hero of the Horde. You will also need to return the Ward of the Defiler so that the Fallen Hero can destroy it, preventing it from ever falling into the wrong hands."] = "消灭污染者拉瑟莱克，将污染者之角交给部落英雄的灵魂。另外你还要把污染者防护结界交给他，这样部落英雄的灵魂就可以消灭它，以避免它落入邪恶势力之手。",
    ["Destroy the Altar of the Tides with Catelyn's Blade, kill Gazban and bring the Stone of the Tides and Catelyn's Blade back to Baron Revilgaz."] = "用凯特琳的匕首摧毁海潮祭坛，然后杀死加兹班，将海潮之石带给大财主里维加兹。",
    ["Destroy the Ancient Moonstone Seal at the ancient flame in Ameth'Aran, then return to Asterion in Bashal'Aran."] = "用亚米萨兰废墟中的远古火焰摧毁远古月亮石封印，然后回到巴莎兰的阿斯特利安那里。",
    ["Destroy the Cirrusfly Queen in Thendal Grove."] = "消灭森达尔林地的卷云蝇后。",
    ["Destroy the flying machine at Bael Modan and return to Gann Stonespire."] = "摧毁巴尔莫丹的飞行器，然后向加恩·石塔回复。",
    ["Dizzy One-Eye in Booty Bay wants you to retrieve his eye from the Bloodsail Buccaneers."] = "藏宝海湾的独眼迪兹要求你从血帆海盗那里找回他的眼睛。",
    ["Doctor Draxlegauge in Faldir's Cove wants you to collect 10 Elven Gems and return the Goggles of Gem Hunting once you are done."] = "法迪尔海湾的德拉克里格博士要你去收集10块精灵宝石并在完成任务后归还寻宝潜水镜。",
    ["Donova Snowden in Winterspring wants you to defeat High Chief Winterfall."] = "冬泉谷的多诺瓦·雪山要你去击败冬泉酋长。",
    ["Ebru in the Wailing Caverns wants you to kill 7 Deviate Ravagers, 7 Deviate Vipers, 7 Deviate Shamblers and 7 Deviate Dreadfangs."] = "哀嚎洞穴的厄布鲁要求你杀掉7只变异破坏者、7只剧毒飞蛇、7只变异蹒跚者和7只变异尖牙风蛇。",
    ["Ensure Miran and the shipment arrive at the excavation site, then inform Prospector Ironband."] = "确保把米兰和货物送到挖掘场，然后通知勘察员基恩萨·铁环。",
    ["Enter the Hall of Thanes beneath Old Ironforge and claim the Head of Durgen Dirgehammer."] = "深入旧铁炉堡底层的领主大厅，拿回杜根·挽锤的徽记。",
    ["Eridan Bluewind in Felwood wants you to kill 8 Jadefire Hellcallers, 8 Jadefire Betrayers, 8 Jadefire Tricksters, and Xavaric. Return to Eridan when the task is completed."] = "费伍德森林的艾瑞丹·蓝风要你去杀掉8个碧火唤魔者、8个碧火背叛者、8个碧火欺诈者和萨瓦里克。任务完成之后回到艾瑞丹那里复命。",
    ["Escape the Furbolg cave and meet Terenthis in Auberdine."] = "离开熊怪洞穴，然后去见奥伯丁的特伦希斯。",
    ["Escort Arei to safety, then speak with Kayneth Stillwind in Forest Song, in eastern Ashenvale."] = "护送艾雷到灰谷，然后和灰谷东部的林歌神殿中的凯尼斯·静风谈一谈。",
    ["Escort Galen out of danger, then find his camp in the Swamp of Sorrows and open his strongbox."] = "护送加林逃出困境，然后打开他放在悲伤沼泽营地里的保险箱。",
    ["Escort Kerlonian Evershade to Liladris Moonriver south along the road to find his bag in Darkshore."] = "护送克罗尼亚·恒影到灰谷迈斯特拉岗哨的利拉迪斯·月河那里去。",
    ["Escort Kernobee to the Clockwerk Run exit and then report to Scooty in Booty Bay."] = "将克努比护送到出口，然后向藏宝海湾的斯库提汇报。",
    ["Escort Lakota Windsong from the Darkcloud Pinnacle, and then talk to Thalia Amberhide at Freewind Post."] = "护送拉克塔·风歌离开恐怖图腾营地，然后与乱风岗的萨利亚谈一谈。",
    ["Escort Mist to Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak at the moon well near the Oracle Tree."] = "护送密斯特去神谕之树附近的月亮井旁找哨兵阿瑞尼亚·碎云。",
    ["Escort Taelan Fordring out of Hearthglen."] = "护送泰兰·弗丁走出壁炉谷。",
    ["Escort Torek on his attack against Silverwing Outpost and Duriel Moonfire, then report to Ertog Ragetusk at Splintertree Post."] = "保护在银翼哨站与杜瑞尔·月火作战的托雷克，然后向慰籍之林的埃尔托格·怒齿汇报胜利的消息。",
    ["Escort the Gizelton Caravan through Mannoroc Coven. Talk with Smeed at Scrabblescrew's Camp for your reward."] = "护送基泽尔顿车队通过玛诺洛克集会所，然后与瑟卡布斯库的营地的斯米德谈一谈，领取你的奖励。",
    ["Executor Arren wants you to kill 10 Young Night Web Spiders and 8 Night Web Spiders."] = "执行官阿伦要你去杀掉10只小夜行蜘蛛和8只夜行蜘蛛。",
    ["Executor Zygand in the town of Brill wants you to assassinate Captain Melrache and his two bodyguards."] = "布瑞尔的执行官塞加德要求你刺杀麦拉其队长及他的两名保镖。",
    ["Explore Frostmane Hold, and kill 5 Frostmane Headhunters for Senir Whitebeard in Kharanos."] = "侦查霜鬃巨魔要塞，替卡拉诺斯的森内尔·白须杀掉5个霜鬃猎头者。",
    ["Far Seer Mok'thardin of Grom'gol needs Holy Spring Water. He also wants you to kill 10 Naga Explorers."] = "格罗姆高营地的先知摩克萨尔丁要你去取回一瓶圣泉之水，同时还要求你杀死10名纳迦探险者。",
    ["Farmer Saldean wants you to kill 20 Harvest Watchers."] = "农夫萨丁要求你破坏掉20台看守傀儡。",
    ["Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Bindings of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Bindings, 6 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 1 Arcane Crystal and 1 Nexus Crystal."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的腕轮、6块布衣碎片、1块奥术水晶和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的英尼戈·蒙托尔神父，他会为你制作一副信仰腕轮。",
    ["Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Gloves of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Gloves, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps and 4 Mooncloth."] = "如果你将1双被玷污的手套、8块布衣碎片和4张月布交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的英尼戈·蒙托尔神父，他会为你制作一双信仰手套。",
    ["Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Leggings of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Leggings, 20 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1件被玷污的护腿、20块布衣碎片、4张月布和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的英尼戈·蒙托尔神父，他会为你制作一件信仰护腿。",
    ["Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Sandals of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Sandals, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1双被玷污的便鞋、12块布衣碎片、2张月布和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的英尼戈·蒙托尔神父，他会为你制作一双信仰便鞋。",
    ["Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Shoulderpads of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Shoulderpads, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的肩垫、12块布衣碎片、2张月布和3块熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的英尼戈·蒙托尔神父，他会为你制作一对信仰肩垫。",
    ["Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Belt of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Belt, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Arcane Crystals and 2 Mooncloth."] = "如果你将1条被玷污的腰带、8块布衣碎片、2块奥术水晶和2张月布交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的英尼戈·蒙托尔神父，他会为你制作一条信仰腰带。",
    ["Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Circlet of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Circlet, 15 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 3 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1件被玷污的头环、15块布衣碎片、3张月布和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的英尼戈·蒙托尔神父，他会为你制作一件信仰头环。",
    ["Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Robe of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Robe, 25 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1件被玷污的长袍、25块布衣碎片、4张月布和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的英尼戈·蒙托尔神父，他会为你制作一件信仰长袍。",
    ["Fight to the top of Jintha'Alor, kill Vile Priestess Hexx for the key to Sharpbeak's cage, and save Sharpbeak."] = "到辛萨罗山顶去，杀掉邪恶祭司海克斯，找到沙普比克笼子的钥匙，然后救出沙普比克。",
    ["Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon.Use the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines to force the corrupted Noxxious Scion to emerge.Heal 8 plants by killing these Noxxious Scion, then return to Vark Battlescar in Shadowprey Village."] = "在玛拉顿里用天蓝水瓶在橙色水晶池中装满水。  在维利斯塔姆藤蔓上使用装满水的天蓝水瓶，使堕落的诺克赛恩幼体出现。  治疗8株植物并杀死那些诺克赛恩幼体，然后向葬影村的瓦克·战痕复命。",
    ["Fill the Empty Cleansing Bowl at the Auberdine Moonwell.Gather a sample of fruit, nut, and grain from the northern Blackwood furbolg camps.Mix the bowl and place it near the bonfire closest to the Cliffspring River at the northern camp, thus summoning the satyr corruptor.Take the Talisman of Corruption and bring it to Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine."] = "在空的净化碗里盛满奥伯丁月亮井的井水。  在黑木熊怪的北部营地里收集水果、坚果和谷物各一份。  将水和三种食物混合起来，放置在壁泉河附近的营火边，这样就会召来唤引诱熊怪堕落的萨特。  取回堕落护符，将它交给奥伯丁的桑迪斯·织风。",
    ["Find 10 pieces of Soft-shelled Clam Meat and bring it back to Mai'Lahii at Shadowprey Village."] = "找到10块软壳蚌肉，把它们交给葬影村的麦拉斯。",
    ["Find 3 Soran'ruk Fragments and 1 Large Soran'ruk Fragment and return them to Doan Karhan in the Barrens."] = "找到3块索兰鲁克宝珠的碎片和1块索兰鲁克宝珠的大碎片，把它们交给贫瘠之地的杜安·卡汉。",
    ["Find Borelgore in the northern wastes of Eastern Plaguelands and destroy him. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller when the mission is complete."] = "找到东瘟疫之地北方荒原中的淤血虫并消灭它。任务完成之后，向纳萨诺斯·凋零者复命。",
    ["Find Deathguard Kel and heal his wounds using Lesser Heal (Rank 2). Afterwards, grant him Power Word: Fortitude and then return to Dark Cleric Beryl in Brill."] = "找到亡灵士兵科尔并使用次级治疗术（等级 2）来治疗他。然后对他施放真言术：韧，最后向布瑞尔的黑暗牧师贝里尔复命。",
    ["Find Duskwing and slay him. From the corpse, recover a Patch of Duskwing's Fur and return it to Nathanos Blightcaller.It is said that Duskwing roams the countryside to the north of Marris Stead."] = "找到暗翼蝠并杀掉它。从尸体上取下一块暗翼蝠的皮，并把它交给纳萨诺斯·凋零者。  据说暗翼蝠游荡在玛瑞斯农场北面的荒原上。",
    ["Find Eliza's grave. Retrieve the Embalmer's Heart from her, then return to Ello Ebonlocke."] = "找到伊莉莎的坟墓，从她的身上取回藏尸者的心脏，把它交给艾尔罗·埃伯洛克。",
    ["Find Grunt Kor'ja and heal her wounds using Lesser Heal (Rank 2). Afterwards, grant her Power Word: Fortitude and then return to Tai'jin at Razor Hill."] = "找到步兵科雅，用次级治疗术（等级 2）治疗她，然后为她加上真言术：韧，最后向剃刀岭的泰金复命。",
    ["Find Kor'ghan in Orgrimmar and get the Venomtail Antidote. Then bring the antidote to Rhinag near the northwestern border of Durotar."] = "找到毒尾蝎的解毒剂，把它交给杜隆塔尔西北边境的林纳格。",
    ["Find Mountaineer Dolf and heal his wounds using Lesser Heal (Rank 2). Afterwards, grant him Power Word: Fortitude and then return to Maxan Anvol in Kharanos."] = "找到巡山人多尔夫并使用次级治疗术（等级 2）来治疗他。然后对他施放真言术：韧，最后向卡拉诺斯的马克萨恩·安沃尔复命。",
    ["Find Phin Odelic in Southshore."] = "到南海镇去找到费恩·奥德利克。",
    ["Find Pilot Hildelve."] = "找到驾驶员莫里·铁钻。",
    ["Find Rackmore's Silver Key. Find Rackmore's Golden Key. Find and open Rackmore's Chest."] = "找到拉克摩尔的银钥匙和金钥匙。找到并打开拉克摩尔的箱子。",
    ["Find Ryedol's Lucky Pick and return it to Prospector Ryedol south of Hammertoe's Dig Site."] = "找到雷杜尔的好运锄，把它交给铁趾挖掘场南边的勘察员雷杜尔。",
    ["Find Sentinel Shaya and heal her wounds using Lesser Heal (Rank 2). Afterwards, grant her Power Word: Fortitude and then return to Laurna Morninglight in Dolanaar."] = "找到哨兵莎恩雅并使用次级治疗术（等级 2）来治疗她。然后对她施放真言术：韧，最后向多兰纳尔的劳尔娜·晨光复命。",
    ["Find Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus."] = "到达纳苏斯去找到泰兰德·语风。",
    ["Find and defeat the crocolisk Daggerfang and bring back Marek's knife."] = "找到并消灭那只名叫刀齿鳄的鳄鱼，把马雷克的刀给带回来。",
    ["Find and kill \"the Collector\" then return to Marshal Dughan with The Collector's Ring."] = "找到“收货人”并将他杀掉，然后带着收货人的戒指回来见治安官杜汉。",
    ["Find and return Bingles' supplies:Bingles' Wrench, Bingles' Screwdriver, Bingles' Hammer, and Bingles' Blastencapper."] = "找回宾格斯的装备： 宾格斯的气压炸弹、宾格斯的扳手、宾格斯的榔头和宾格斯的螺丝起子。",
    ["Find and return the Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass to Taskmaster Scrange in the Searing Gorge.The only information you have about these items is the following: They were definitely stolen by Dark Iron dwarves. The Smithing Tuyere is a blacksmithing tool used by blacksmiths and the Lookout's Spyglass is an invaluable monitoring tool to lookouts."] = "找到冶炼鼓风机和侦查员的望远镜，把它们还给灼热峡谷的监工斯克兰格。  你所知道的关于这些物品的惟一信息是：它们肯定是被黑铁矮人偷走的。冶炼鼓风机是铁匠用的锻造工具，侦查员的望远镜是侦查员所需的侦查工具。",
    ["Find and slay a Thunderhawk, return its wings to Jorn Skyseer at Camp Taurajo."] = "找到一只雷鹰，杀掉它，然后把它的翅膀交给陶拉祖营地的乔恩·星眼。",
    ["Find someone who knows of Ghost Howl. Provided item:."] = "去打听打听谁听说过鬼嚎。",
    ["Find the 12 missing pages of the Shredder Operating Manual, and put them together to form Chapters 1, 2, and 3. Return the pages to Gurda Ragescar near Splintertree Post."] = "找到丢失的12页伐木机操作指南，把它们合并为第1、2、3章。然后带着这些书页回到碎木岗哨去找古尔达·怒痕。",
    ["Find the author of the message in a bottle."] = "找到瓶中信的作者。",
    ["First Mate Nilzlix wants you to retrieve the Charts and Logs from the Maiden's Folly and the Spirit of Silverpine."] = "大副尼兹利克斯让你从处女号和银松之魂号中取回航海图和航海日志。",
    ["Follow Donova Snowden's instructions, then report back."] = "根据多诺瓦·雪山的指示行动，然后回到她那里报告。",
    ["For 110 Insignias of the Dawn and 110 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache."] = "如果你有110枚银色黎明徽记和110枚十字军徽记，就能从银色黎明库存的宝藏中挑选一件物品。",
    ["For 30 Insignias of the Dawn and 30 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache."] = "如果你有30枚银色黎明徽记和30枚十字军徽记，就能从银色黎明库存的宝藏中挑选一件物品。",
    ["Gar'Thok of Razor Hill wants you to retrieve 3 Gnomish Tools from the wreckage off the coast."] = "剃刀岭的加索克要你从海岸边的舰队残骸中打捞出3件侏儒的工具。",
    ["Gather 5 Intact Raptor Horns from Sunscale Scytheclaws, and bring them to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet."] = "从赤鳞镰爪龙身上收集5根完整的迅猛龙角，把它们交给棘齿城的米希瑞克斯。",
    ["Gather 5 Notched Ribs and 3 Blackened Skulls, then return to Deathguard Dillinger in Brill."] = "收集5根锯齿肋骨和3个焦黑的颅骨，然后向布瑞尔的亡灵卫兵迪林格尔回报。",
    ["Gather 6 Underbelly Whelp Scales from Black Dragon Whelps, and bring them to Verner Osgood in Redridge."] = "从黑龙雏龙身上收集6片雏龙的腹鳞，把它们交给赤脊山的弗纳·奥斯古。",
    ["Gather Searing Collars from the cultists in Skull Rock.Bring them to Margoz at his camp."] = "在骷髅石中的火刃祭司身上收集灼热项圈，  然后交给玛高兹。",
    ["Gershala Nightwhisper in Auberdine wants 8 Corrupt Brain stems."] = "奥伯丁的戈沙拉·夜语需要8块堕落者的脑干。",
    ["Get 10 Scorpid Worker Tails for Gornek in the Den."] = "给大兽穴中的高内克带回10根工蝎的尾巴。",
    ["Get 5 pieces of Crocolisk Meat and 6 Crocolisk Skins for Marek Ironheart at the Farstrider Lodge."] = "收集5块鳄鱼肉和6张鳄鱼皮，把它们交给旅行者营地里的马雷克·铁心。",
    ["Get 7 pieces of Scrap Metal for Sigrun."] = "帮西格鲁收集7块金属碎片。",
    ["Get the Book of the Ancients and return it to Azore Aldamort at the tower in Ethel Rethor."] = "拿到上古之书，将其交给艾瑟雷索塔中的阿佐尔·奥达蒙特。",
    ["Get the mysterious ore from Piznik after he finishes mining it."] = "在匹兹尼克完成开采之后拿到神秘矿石。",
    ["Give Deliana your Helm of Valor and Breastplate of Valor."] = "将你的勇气头盔与勇气胸甲交给德莉亚娜。",
    ["Give Marshal Maxwell the bad news."] = "把这个坏消息传达给麦克斯韦尔元帅。",
    ["Give Sara Timberlain the Stormwind Armor Marker."] = "把暴风城护甲标记交给萨拉·迪博雷恩。",
    ["Give the cask of Evershine to Pilot Bellowfiz at Steelgrill's Depot."] = "把这桶艾沃沙酒交给钢架补给站的驾驶员贝隆·风箱。",
    ["Go to the Shards of Myzrael, summon her and defeat her.Gather her Eldritch Shackles and bind them to the Shards of Myzrael."] = "到密斯莱尔水晶碎块去召唤她，然后打败她。  搜出她身上的怪异镣铐，将其和密斯莱尔水晶碎块缚在一起。",
    ["Go with Ogron to speak with Reethe, then return to Krog in Brackenwall Village."] = "和奥格隆一起去和雷瑟谈一谈，然后回到蕨墙村见克罗格。",
    ["Grab a Flawed Power Stone. Bring it to the Altar of Fire before the stone expires, then return to Ak'Zeloth."] = "取一块有瑕疵的能量石。在能量石失去魔法之前把它带到火焰祭坛去，然后向雅克塞罗斯复命。",
    ["Grazle wants you to prove yourself by killing 5 Deadwood Warriors, 5 Deadwood Pathfinders, and 5 Deadwood Gardeners."] = "格拉兹要你去杀死6个死木战士、6个死木探路者以及6个死木园丁。",
    ["Greetings, champion. I am Jonathan, keeper of the sacred gong and eternal watcher of the Bronze Flight.I have been empowered by the Timeless One himself to grant you an item of your choosing from his timeless treasure trove. May it aid you in your battles against C'Thun."] = "你好，勇士。我是神圣之锣和青铜龙军团的永恒观察者，乔纳森。  你好，勇士。我是神圣之锣和青铜龙军团的永恒观察者，乔纳森。",
    ["Grelin Whitebeard wants you to kill Grik'nir the Cold, and retrieve his journal."] = "格瑞林·白须要你去杀掉冷酷的格瑞克尼尔，并取回他的日记。",
    ["Grelin Whitebeard would like you to kill 14 Frostmane Troll Whelps."] = "格瑞林·白须要你去杀掉14个霜鬃巨魔幼崽。",
    ["Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 10 Mountain Cougar Pelts."] = "纳拉其营地的格鲁尔·鹰风要求你带给他10张山狮皮。",
    ["Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to bring him 7 Plainstrider Feathers and 7 pieces of Plainstrider Meat."] = "纳拉其营地的格鲁尔·鹰风要求你带给他7片平原陆行鸟的羽毛和7块平原陆行鸟肉。",
    ["Grull Hawkwind in Camp Narache wants you to kill Battleboars and bring back 8 Battleboar Snouts and 8 Battleboar Flanks."] = "纳拉其营地的格鲁尔·鹰风要求你去干掉斗猪，并带给他4块斗猪头和4块斗猪肋排。",
    ["Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Greater Lava Spiders in the Searing Gorge. You can find Greater Lava Spiders in the plateaus and lava pools of the Searing Gorge.Return to Hansel Heavyhands in the Searing Gorge when you have killed enough Greater Lava Spiders."] = "汉瑟尔·重拳要你杀死灼热峡谷中的20只巨型熔岩蜘蛛。你可以在灼热峡谷的高地和熔岩池里找到巨型熔岩蜘蛛。  当你杀死足够的巨型熔岩蜘蛛之后，回到汉瑟尔·重拳那里复命。",
    ["Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Heavy War Golems.The Heavy War Golems wander the areas surrounding the Cauldron in the Searing Gorge. When you've killed enough, return to Hansel in Searing Gorge."] = "汉瑟尔·重拳让你杀掉20个重型作战傀儡。  重型作战傀儡就在灼热峡谷的大熔炉附近。当你杀死足够多的傀儡后，就回去找汉瑟尔·重拳。",
    ["Hear Zamael tell his tale."] = "听萨麦尔讲述他的故事。",
    ["Help Deathstalker Faerleia kill the Pyrewood Council."] = "帮助亡灵哨兵费雷亚消灭焚木村议会。",
    ["Help Marshal Windsor get his gear back and free his friends. Return to Marshal Maxwell if you succeed."] = "帮助温德索尔元帅拿回他的装备并救出他的朋友。当你成功之后就回去向麦克斯韦尔元帅复命。",
    ["Help Pal'juh escape Kolkar Crag and bring news of your success to Master Vornal in Sen'jin Village."] = "帮助帕尔朱逃离科卡尔峭壁，然后前往森金村，向沃纳尔大师报个平安。",
    ["Help Sentinel Lynessa Duskblossom escape Ban'ethil Barrow Den, and report her is safety to Sentinel Kyra Starsong in Dolanaar."] = "帮助哨兵莱妮莎·暮花逃出班奈希尔兽穴，并向多兰纳尔的哨兵凯拉·星歌禀报她已安全脱险。",
    ["Help Walton survive the encounter with Terry Longdrink and the Kul Tiras marines."] = "帮助沃尔顿在遭遇泰瑞·长饮和库尔提拉斯水兵时活下来。",
    ["Hemet Nesingwary wants you to bring him the head of King Bangalash, the great white tiger."] = "赫米特·奈辛瓦里要求你将虎王邦加拉什的头带回来给他。",
    ["Hemet Nesingwary wants you to kill Tethis, an elusive, dangerous raptor in Stranglethorn."] = "赫米特·奈辛瓦里要求你杀死荆棘谷中最危险最狡猾的迅猛龙泰希斯。",
    ["High Executor Darthalia of Tarren Mill is offering a bounty on Clerk Horrace Whitesteed, Citizen Wilkes, Miner Hackett and Farmer Kalaba."] = "塔伦米尔的高级执行官达萨利亚悬赏通缉书记员赫拉斯·怀特斯蒂德、平民维尔克斯、矿工哈克特和农夫卡拉巴。",
    ["Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Boots if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1双被玷污的长靴、12块锁甲碎片、1块奥金锭和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一双地穴追猎者长靴。",
    ["Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Handguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的手甲、8块锁甲碎片、1块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一副地穴追猎者护手。",
    ["Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Legguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Legguards, 20 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 3 Arcanite Bars and 5 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1条被玷污的腿甲、20块锁甲碎片、3块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一条地穴追猎者腿甲。",
    ["Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Spaulders if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Spaulders, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的肩饰、12块锁甲碎片、2块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一副地穴追猎者肩饰。",
    ["Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Wristguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 2 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的腕甲、6块锁甲碎片、1块奥金锭和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一副地穴追猎者腕甲。",
    ["Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Cryptstalker Girdle if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1条被玷污的束带、8块锁甲碎片、1块奥金锭和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一条地穴追猎者束带。",
    ["Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Cryptstalker Headpiece if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1件被玷污的头饰、15块锁甲碎片、4块奥金锭和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一件地穴追猎者头饰。",
    ["Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Cryptstalker Tunic if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1件被玷污的外套、25块锁甲碎片、4块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的猎手雷奥普德，他会为你制作一件地穴追猎者外套。",
    ["Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to recover his twin brother's remains. Find and return Huntsman Malkhor's Skull and Huntsman Malkhor's Bones to Huntsman Markhor.Markhor mentioned that his brother's remains were fed to the oozes and wolves of the Vilebranch. He also mentioned that there is a refuse pit filled with oozes in Jintha'alor as well as a wolf den. Both of these places are near the top of the temple."] = "辛特兰恶齿村的猎户马克霍尔要你去找回他的双胞胎兄弟的尸体。找到它，然后把猎户莫克霍尔的头颅和猎户莫克霍尔的骨头交给猎户马克霍尔。  马克霍尔说过，他兄弟的尸体被软泥怪和邪枝巨魔的狼群分食。他还提到在辛萨罗有个大坑，里面全都是软泥怪，那里还有个狼穴。这两个地方都在靠近辛萨罗神庙顶部的区域。",
    ["Investigate the disappearance of Edward Heartweaver in the Ruins of Lordaeron."] = "前往洛丹伦废墟，调查爱德华·织心的失踪之谜。",
    ["Kill 10 Boulderfist Brutes and 4 Boulderfist Magi, and return to Drum Fel in the Hammerfall outpost."] = "杀死10个石拳蛮兵和4个石拳法师，然后向落锤村哨所的杜拉姆法尔复命。",
    ["Kill 10 Highlands Bandits and their leader, \"Badwind\" Bennic in the Shen'dar Highlands."] = "在申达尔高地消灭10名高地强盗，并除掉他们的首领“恶风”本尼克。",
    ["Kill 10 Marsh Murlocs, 10 Marsh Inkspewer, and 10 Marsh Flesheater, then return to Katar in the Swamp of Sorrows."] = "杀掉10个沼泽鱼人、10个沼泽喷墨鱼人和10个沼泽食腐鱼人，然后向悲伤沼泽的卡塔尔回报。",
    ["Kill 10 Mottled Boars then return to Gornek at the Den."] = "杀掉10只杂斑野猪，然后向大兽穴里的高内克报告。",
    ["Kill 10 Pterrordax and 15 Frenzied Pterrordax, then speak to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge."] = "杀掉10只翼手龙和15只狂怒的翼手龙，然后向马绍尔营地的斯普拉格·弗劳克报告。",
    ["Kill 10 Syndicate Rogues and 10 Syndicate Watchmen. Return to High Executor Darthalia in Tarren Mill for your reward."] = "杀死10个辛迪加潜行者和10个辛迪加哨兵，然后回到塔伦米尔向高级执行官达萨利亚报告。",
    ["Kill 12 Dustwind Savages and 8 Dustwind Storm Witches for Rezlak near Drygulch Ravine."] = "为奥格瑞玛附近的雷兹拉克杀掉12个尘风暴徒和8个尘风雷巫。",
    ["Kill 12 Fen Creepers, then return to Rethiel the Greenwarden in the Wetlands."] = "杀死12只沼泽爬行者，然后向湿地的绿色守卫者雷希耶尔复命。",
    ["Kill 12 Kobold Laborers, then return to Marshal McBride at Northshire Abbey."] = "杀死12只狗头人苦力，然后向北郡修道院里的治安官玛克布莱德复命。",
    ["Kill 12 Rattlecage Skeletons, and then return to Shadow Priest Sarvis in Deathknell when you are done."] = "杀掉12个断骨骷髅，然后回到丧钟镇的暗影牧师萨维斯那里。",
    ["Kill 12 Syndicate Footpads and 8 Syndicate Thieves, then return to Magistrate Henry Maleb in Southshore."] = "杀死12个辛迪加劫匪和8个辛迪加潜行者，然后回到南海镇向赫尼·马雷布镇长报到。",
    ["Kill 12 Vile Familiars.Return to Zureetha Fargaze outside the Den."] = "杀死12只邪灵劣魔，然后向大兽穴外的祖雷萨复命。",
    ["Kill 14 Crushridge Maulers for Melisara in Tarren Mill."] = "塔伦米尔的梅里萨拉要你去杀掉14个破碎岭虐待者。",
    ["Kill 15 Enraged Apparitions, 10 Tormented Souls and put the spirit of Anvilmar to rest."] = "消灭15个被激怒的幽灵、10个被折磨的幽魂，让安威玛尔的灵魂得到安息。",
    ["Kill 15 Pygmy Venom Web Spiders, and then report back to Watcher Dodds in Duskwood."] = "守夜人道茨要你杀15只小型结网毒蜘蛛。",
    ["Kill 5 Elder Mountain Boars and return to Daryl the Youngling in the Farstrider Lodge within 12 minutes."] = "杀掉5只老山猪，然后回到旅行者营地去见年轻的达瑞尔，时限为12分钟。",
    ["Kill 6 Kurzen Elite, 4 Kurzen Subchiefs, and bring Kurzen's Head to Lieutenant Doren at the Rebel Camp."] = "杀掉6名库尔森精英和4名库尔森副首领，并将库尔森的头颅交给反抗军营地里的多伦上尉。",
    ["Kill 6 Mountain Buzzards and return to Daryl the Youngling in the Farstrider Lodge within 15 minutes."] = "杀死6只山鹫，然后回到旅行者营地见年轻的达瑞尔，时限为15分钟。",
    ["Kill 7 Deviate Ravagers, 7 Deviate Vipers, 7 Deviate Shamblers and 7 Deviate Dreadfangs. Ebru offers a choice of Pattern: Deviate Scale Belt, Sizzle Stick, or Dagmire Gauntlets. The belt is crafted afterwards."] = "哀嚎洞穴的厄布鲁要求你杀掉7只变异破坏者、7只剧毒飞蛇、7只变异蹒跚者和7只变异尖牙风蛇。",
    ["Kill 7 Young Nightsabers and 4 Young Thistle Boars and return to Conservator Ilthalaine."] = "杀死7只夜刃豹幼崽和4只草刺野猪幼崽，然后向管理员伊尔萨莱恩复命。",
    ["Kill 8 Befouled Webwoods and bring Xethorr the Wicked's Mature Fel Moss to Tallonkai Swiftroot in Dolanaar."] = "消灭8只被污染的树林蜘蛛，并将邪恶的泽索尔手中成熟的魔苔带给多兰纳尔的塔隆凯·捷根。",
    ["Kill 8 Razormane Geomancers, 8 Razormane Defenders, and Kreenig Snarlsnout.Then bring Kreenig Snarlsnout's Tusk to Thork at the Crossroads."] = "杀掉8个钢鬃地卜师、8个钢鬃防御者和他们的头目克里尼格·糟鼻。  把克里尼格·糟鼻的獠牙交给十字路口的索克。",
    ["Kill 8 Wailing Ancestors and 8 Rotting Ancestors.Kill Captain Dargol, and bring his skull to Magistrate Sevren in Brill."] = "杀死8个哀嚎的鬼魂和8个腐烂的古尸。  消灭达高尔队长，并将他的颅骨交给布瑞尔的执政官塞弗伦。",
    ["Kill Ambassador Infernus in Angor Fortress and bring proof of his death to Advisor Belgrum in Ironforge."] = "杀死苦痛堡垒中的因弗努斯大使，把证明他已死亡的信物交给铁炉堡的顾问贝尔格拉姆。",
    ["Kill Balgaras the Foul and bring his ear to Longbraid the Grim outside of Dun Modr."] = "杀死邪恶的巴尔加拉斯，把他的耳朵带给丹莫德外的布莱德·长须。",
    ["Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker before returning to Thrall in Orgrimmar."] = "杀死巴扎兰和祈求者耶戈什，然后回到奥格瑞玛的萨尔那里。",
    ["Kill Besseleth and bring Besseleth's Fang to Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat."] = "杀掉贝瑟莱斯，然后把贝瑟莱斯的牙齿交给烈日石居的马格兰。",
    ["Kill Bristlebacks in Brambleblade Ravine and bring 12 Bristleback Belts to Chief Hawkwind in Camp Narache."] = "杀掉刺刃峡谷的刺背野猪人并带回12条刺背腰带，把它们交给纳拉其营地的鹰风酋长。",
    ["Kill Chieftain Nek'roshBring Nek'rosh's Head to Captain Stoutfist."] = "杀掉纳克罗什酋长。  将纳克罗什的头颅交给斯托菲队长。",
    ["Kill Garrick Padfoot and bring his head to Deputy Willem at Northshire Abbey."] = "杀死加瑞克·帕德弗特，带着他的头到北郡修道院去找维里副队长。",
    ["Kill Geltharis and return the Branch of Cenarius to Illiyana at the Shrine of Aessina."] = "杀掉加萨里斯，把塞纳留斯的树枝交给艾森娜神殿的伊莉亚娜。",
    ["Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod, the Scarlet Champion and Houndmaster Loksey and then report back to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore."] = "杀死大检察官怀特迈恩，血色十字军指挥官莫格莱尼，十字军的勇士赫洛德和驯犬者洛克希并向南海镇的莱雷恩复命。",
    ["Kill Infiltrator Hameya. Use his key on the Mound of Dirt behind the Undercroft."] = "杀了渗透者哈米亚，用他的钥匙开启墓室后的一堆泥土。",
    ["Kill Ivar the Foul, and bring Ivar's Head to Rane Yorick at the Ivar Patch."] = "杀死邪恶的伊瓦，并将伊瓦的头颅带给伊瓦农庄的兰妮·尤瑞克。",
    ["Kill Mangeclaw.Bring his Mangy Claw and Hildelve's Journal to Pilot Hammerfoot."] = "杀死癞爪。  把它的肮脏的爪子和莫里·铁钻的日记交给驾驶员塞克·锤足。",
    ["Kill Meven Korgal, the messenger, at the Crusader camp, then return any information you find to Executor Arren."] = "到十字军营地去杀掉信使迈文·考加尔，将你发现的情报交给执行官阿伦。",
    ["Kill Moora and Salia, and bring Shadow Lord Fel'dan's Head to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood."] = "杀掉米莱恩和萨莉亚，并把暗影领主费尔丹的头颅交给费伍德森林的格雷塔·苔蹄。",
    ["Kill Rath'mael in the Ruins of Lordaeron for Deathguard Kristof in Brill."] = "在洛丹伦废墟击杀拉斯玛尔，向布瑞尔的亡灵卫兵克里斯托弗复命。",
    ["Kill Rot Hide Graverobbers and Rot Hide Mongrels. Bring 8 Embalming Ichors to Magistrate Sevren in Brill."] = "杀死腐皮盗墓贼和混血腐皮豺狼人。  给布瑞尔的执政官塞弗伦带回8瓶防腐剂。",
    ["Kill Sarkoth and bring his claw back to Hana'zua."] = "杀死萨科斯并将它的爪子带回去交给哈纳祖。",
    ["Kill Stalvan Mistmantle and show Madame Eva his family ring."] = "干掉斯塔文·密斯特曼托，把他的家族戒指带给伊瓦夫人看看。",
    ["Kill Supervisor Fizsprocket and return his clipboard to Morin Cloudstalker at Bloodhoof Village."] = "杀掉菲兹普罗克主管，把他的笔记板带给血蹄村的摩林·云行者。",
    ["Kill Tazan and bring his Satchel to Therzok in the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar."] = "杀死塔赞，把他的背包带给奥格瑞玛暗影裂口的瑟祖克。",
    ["Kill Ursal the Mauler and return to Athridas Bearmantle in Dolanaar."] = "杀掉大槌乌萨尔，然后回到多兰纳尔的阿斯瑞达斯·熊皮那里。",
    ["Kill Valdred Moray.Bring his hands to Raleigh Andrean in the Undercity."] = "杀掉瓦德雷·莫莱。  把他的双手带给幽暗城的拉林夫·安迪恩。",
    ["Kill Vulgara the Insatiable in the Shen'dar Highlands and bring her head to Danarii Bellowveil."] = "在申达尔高地消灭贪得无厌的乌尔加拉，将她的头颅带给达纳瑞·怒面。",
    ["Kill rot hide gnolls at the Dead Fields.When Nightlash appears, kill her.Bring the Essence of Nightlash to High Executor Hadrec at the Sepulcher."] = "清剿亡者农场的腐皮豺狼人。  当奈塔拉什出现时，把她也杀掉。  将奈塔拉什的灵魂带给瑟伯切尔的高级执行官哈德瑞克。",
    ["Kill the Dalaran archmage, then retrieve his staff for Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher."] = "杀死达拉然大法师，并把他的法杖交给瑟伯切尔的暗影牧师奥利斯特。",
    ["Kill the Trogg leader, Grawmug, and his two guards, Gnasher and Brawler then report back to Captain Rugelfuss in the southern guard tower."] = "杀掉穴居人首领格劳姆格及他的两个护卫，纳什尔和布劳勒尔。然后回到南部警戒塔向拉格弗斯上尉报告。",
    ["Kill the druids: Taneel Darkwood, Uthil Mooncall, Mavoris Cloudsbreak; then return to Kayneth Stillwind in Forest Song."] = "杀死这些德鲁伊：坦尼尔·黑木、尤希尔·唤月和玛沃里斯·裂云，然后向慰藉之林中的凯尼斯·静风复命。",
    ["Kill the group of Shadow Silk Poachers that wander the Searing Gorge. Nilith has reason to believe that there are five of them that need to be exterminated. Return to Nilith in the Searing Gorge when this task is complete."] = "杀死在灼热峡谷游荡的暗影蛛丝偷猎者小队。尼莉丝认为他们共有5名成员，你的任务就是把他们全都干掉。",
    ["Kill the leader of the Talon Den, Rynthariel the Keymaster."] = "杀死猛禽洞穴的领袖琳萨瑞尔。",
    ["Kill the sea giant along Durotar's north coast and bring back proof of your accomplishment."] = "消灭杜隆塔尔北部海岸的海巨人，并带回战利品，证明你已将它除掉。",
    ["Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Bracers if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Bracers, 6 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 1 Nexus Crystal."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的护腕、6块板甲碎片、1块奥金锭和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一副无畏护腕。",
    ["Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Gauntlets if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Gauntlets, 8 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的护手、8块板甲碎片、1块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一副无畏护手。",
    ["Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Legplates if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Legplates, 20 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的腿铠、20块板甲碎片、4块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一副无畏腿铠。",
    ["Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Pauldrons if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Pauldrons, 12 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的肩铠、12块板甲碎片、2块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一副无畏肩铠。",
    ["Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreadnaught Sabatons if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Sabatons, 12 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1双被玷污的马靴、12块板甲碎片、2块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一双无畏马靴。",
    ["Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreadnaught Breastplate if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Breastplate, 25 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1件被玷污的胸甲、25块板甲碎片、4块奥金锭和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一件无畏胸甲。",
    ["Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreadnaught Helmet if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Helmet, 15 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 5 Arcanite Bars and 1 Nexus Crystal."] = "如果你将1顶被玷污的头盔、15块板甲碎片、5块奥金锭和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一顶无畏头盔。",
    ["Korfax at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreadnaught Waistguard if you bring him the following items: 1 Desecrated Waistguard, 8 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1条被玷污的护腰、8块板甲碎片、1块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的科尔法克斯，他会为你制作一条无畏护腰。",
    ["Krusk in Tarren Mill needs you to free Drull and Tog'thar from Durnholde Keep."] = "塔伦米尔的克鲁斯克要你把德鲁尔和托格萨从敦霍尔德城堡救出来。",
    ["Lar Prowltusk outside of Sen'jin Village wants you to destroy the 3 sets of Attack Plans held within Kolkar Crag."] = "在森金村外面的拉尔·猎齿要求你粉碎科卡尔峭壁内的三份进攻计划。",
    ["Lead Ringo to Spraggle Frock at Marshal's Refuge.If Ringo faints, use Spraggle's Canteen to revive him."] = "把林格带回马绍尔营地的斯普拉格·弗劳克身边。  如果林格晕倒了，就用斯普拉格的水壶让他恢复。",
    ["Locate Beren's Peril, then kill 6 Ravenclaw Drudgers and 6 Ravenclaw Guardians, then return to Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher."] = "找到博伦的巢穴，杀死6名鸦爪苦工和6名鸦爪守护者，然后向瑟伯切尔的暗影牧师奥利斯特汇报。",
    ["Locate Captain Sanders' chest and open it for your reward. Provided item:."] = "找到杉德尔船长的箱子并打开它，取得你的奖励。",
    ["Locate Zzarc'Vul in the southern ogre mound in Duskwood and return his monocle to Viktori in Darkshire."] = "在暮色森林南部的食人魔土丘上找到扎克乌尔，把他的单片眼镜带回夜色镇交给维克托。",
    ["Locate and retrieve the three Secret Notes in Darkcloud Pinnacle."] = "在黑云峰拿到三封密信。",
    ["Maggran at Sun Rock Retreat wishes you to slay Bloodfury Ripper and bring her remains as proof of your deed."] = "烈日石居的马格兰要你去杀掉血怒撕裂者，然后把她的遗体带回来作为证据。",
    ["Maintain your reputation with the Gelkis, and bring the Maraudine Key Fragment to Uthek the Wise in the Gelkis Village."] = "继续和吉尔吉斯部族保持良好的关系，把玛洛迪钥匙碎片交给吉尔吉斯村的智者乌泰克。",
    ["Marvon Rivetseeker in Tanaris wants you to collect 30 Gahz'ridian Ornaments."] = "塔纳利斯的玛尔冯·瑞文斯克要你收集30件加兹瑞迪安饰物。",
    ["Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Bindings if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Bindings, 6 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 1 Arcane Crystal and 1 Nexus Crystal."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的腕轮、6块布衣碎片、1块奥术水晶和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒者玛塔乌斯，他会为你制作一副瘟疫之心腕轮。",
    ["Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Gloves if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Gloves, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps and 4 Mooncloth."] = "如果你将1双被玷污的手套、8块布衣碎片和4张月布交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒者玛塔乌斯，他会为你制作一双瘟疫之心手套。",
    ["Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Leggings if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Leggings, 20 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的护腿、20块布衣碎片、4张月布和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒者玛塔乌斯，他会为你制作一副瘟疫之心护腿。",
    ["Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Sandals if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Sandals, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1双被玷污的便鞋、12块布衣碎片、2张月布和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒者玛塔乌斯，他会为你制作一双瘟疫之心便鞋。",
    ["Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Shoulderpads if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Shoulderpads, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的肩垫、12块布衣碎片、2张月布和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒者玛塔乌斯，他会为你制作一副瘟疫之心肩垫。",
    ["Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Belt if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Belt, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Arcane Crystals and 2 Mooncloth."] = "如果你将1条被玷污的腰带、8块布衣碎片、2块奥术水晶和2张月布交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒者玛塔乌斯，他会为你制作一条瘟疫之心腰带。",
    ["Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Circlet if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Circlet, 15 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 3 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1个被玷污的头环、15块布衣碎片、3张月布和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒者玛塔乌斯，他会为你制作一个瘟疫之心头饰。",
    ["Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Robe if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Robe, 25 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1件被玷污的长袍、25块布衣碎片、4张月布和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的愤怒者玛塔乌斯，他会为你制作一件瘟疫之心长袍。",
    ["Motley Garmason wants Kam Deepfury's head brought to him at Dun Modr."] = "丹莫德的莫特雷·加玛森要求你把卡姆·深怒的头颅交给他。",
    ["Mudcrush Durtfeet in northern Dustwallow wants 12 Mirefin Heads."] = "尘泥沼泽北部的马德克拉什要你去抓12条泥鳍小鱼。",
    ["Novice Elreth requires 6 Scavenger Paws and 6 Duskbat Wings."] = "新兵艾尔雷斯需要6只食腐狼的爪子和6只夜行蝙蝠翼。",
    ["Oben Rageclaw wants you to kill his soulless body, and then use the Voodoo Charm."] = "奥本·怒爪要求你去杀掉他那失去灵魂的身体，然后对其尸体使用巫毒咒符。",
    ["Open the Resonite cask with the Enchanted Resonite Crystal, and then slay Goggeroc. Return to Mor'rogal with the news and Enchanted Resonite Crystal."] = "使用魔化共鸣水晶打开共鸣桶，然后杀死高戈罗克。将这个消息告诉摩罗加尔，并把魔化共鸣水晶还给他。",
    ["Open the chest and claim your reward."] = "打开箱子，取走你的酬劳。",
    ["Ormer Ironbraid at the Whelgar Excavation Site wants you to kill Sarltooth and return to him with one of his talons once the task is fulfilled."] = "维尔加挖掘场的奥莫尔·铁衣要求你杀死萨尔图斯，并在任务完成之后带着它的一只爪子向他复命。",
    ["Orwin Gizzmick in Camp Mojache wants 12 samples of Gordunni Cobalt."] = "莫沙彻营地的奥尔文·吉兹米克需要12块戈杜尼钴矿石的样本。",
    ["Otho Moji'ko at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to travel to Aerie Peak in the western region of the Hinterlands and place the Final Message to the Wildhammer by the well in the center of town. Return to him once this task is complete.Beware of angry Wildhammer dwarves and unruly members of the Alliance."] = "辛特兰恶齿村的奥索·莫吉克要你去辛特兰西部的鹰巢山，把给蛮锤部族的警告插在城镇中心的水井旁边。任务完成之后回到他那里去复命。  当心那些愤怒的蛮锤矮人以及野蛮的联盟成员。",
    ["Overlord Mok'Morokk in Brackenwall Village wants you to retrieve his grog, snuff and strongbox in Dustwallow Swamp."] = "蕨墙村的莫格穆洛克大王要你从石槌废墟拿回他的烈酒、鼻烟和保险箱。",
    ["Pick up Shay's Bell from the chest.Escort Shay Leafrunner to Rockbiter's camp."] = "从箱子里拿取沙恩的铃铛，然后护送沙恩·飘叶回到罗克比特的营地。",
    ["Place Karang's Banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound. Do not let the furbolgs destroy the banner. Defeat Chief Murgut and bring Murgut's Totem to Karang Amakkar at Zoram'gar."] = "把卡拉恩的旗子插到污林图腾堆中。不要让熊怪摧毁这面旗子。击败穆戈特酋长，将穆戈特的图腾交给佐拉姆加的卡拉恩·阿玛卡。",
    ["Plant 10 Gaea Seeds in Gaea Dirt Mounds, and then return the remaining Enchanted Gaea Seeds to Tammra at Sun Rock Retreat."] = "将10枚盖亚之种种植在盖亚土堆中，然后与烈日石居的塔姆拉谈一谈。",
    ["Priestess A'moora wants you to place Lady Sathrah's silvery spinnerets at the fountain inside the temple, and then return to her."] = "女祭司艾茉拉让你将萨丝拉的银色丝囊放在大殿的喷泉处，然后回去见她。",
    ["Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to recover 10 Vessels of Tainted Blood from Jintha'alor. Return to Primal Torntusk when this task is complete."] = "辛特兰恶齿村的断齿族长要你在辛萨罗找到10瓶腐化之血。任务完成之后就回到断齿族长那里。",
    ["Protect Corporal Keeshan on the journey back to Redridge."] = "保护基沙恩下士回到赤脊。",
    ["Protect Kanati Greycloud from the centaur attack."] = "保护卡纳提·灰云免受半人马的袭击。",
    ["Protect Volcor until you reach the road, then speak to Terenthis in Auberdine."] = "保护沃科尔离开，然后去和奥伯丁的特伦希斯谈一谈。",
    ["Protect Wizzlecrank and the stolen goblin shredder on the way to Sputtervalve in Ratchet."] = "保护维兹克兰克以及他偷来的地精伐木机返回棘齿城的斯布特瓦夫那里。",
    ["Put the spirit of Faldrim Anvilmar to rest in the Hall of Thanes."] = "让法德林·安威玛尔的灵魂安息，然后返回领主大厅，向鬼魅随从复命。",
    ["Raise the standard of Ironforge, call out the trogg Headsplitter and kill it, then report to Captain Rugelfuss."] = "举起铁炉堡的旗帜，引出穴居人劈头斧并将其消灭，然后向拉格弗斯上尉报告。",
    ["Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Boots if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 2 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1双被玷污的长靴、12块皮甲碎片、3张月布和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一双梦游者长靴。",
    ["Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Handguards if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 5 Cured Rugged Hides and 1 Nexus Crystal."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的护手、8块皮甲碎片、5个熟化毛皮和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一副梦游者护手。",
    ["Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Legguards if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Legguards, 20 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 8 Cured Rugged Hides and 1 Nexus Crystal."] = "如果你将1件被玷污的腿甲、20块皮甲碎片、8个熟化毛皮和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一件梦游者腿甲。",
    ["Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Spaulders if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Spaulders, 12 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 5 Cured Rugged Hides and 1 Nexus Crystal."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的肩饰、12块皮甲碎片、5个熟化毛皮和1块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一副梦游者肩饰。",
    ["Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Dreamwalker Wristguards if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 1 Arcane Crystal and 2 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的腕甲、6块皮甲碎片、1块奥术水晶和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一副梦游者腕甲。",
    ["Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreamwalker Girdle if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 2 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1条被玷污的束带、8块皮甲碎片、3张月布和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一条梦游者束带。",
    ["Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreamwalker Headpiece if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 6 Cured Rugged Hides and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1件被玷污的头饰、15块皮甲碎片、6个熟化毛皮和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一件梦游者头饰。",
    ["Rayne at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Dreamwalker Tunic if you bring her the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 6 Cured Rugged Hides and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1件被玷污的外套、25块皮甲碎片、6个熟化毛皮和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱茵，他会为你制作一件梦游者外套。",
    ["Recover \"Geomancy for Curious Young Wizards\" and \"Arcane Explainer: Magical Stuff in Simple Words\" and return them to Brother Paxton inside Northshire's Abbey."] = "取回《好奇小巫师的地卜术》和《奥术详解：用简单的话解释魔法》，并交还给北郡修道院内的帕克斯顿修士。",
    ["Recover Sha'ni's Nose-Ring from Krom'Grul and return it to Thal'trak in Kargath. Search the various caves and mines in Dreadmaul Rock."] = "从克罗格鲁尔手中拿回沙妮的鼻环，把它还给卡加斯的萨特拉克。搜寻巨槌石的每一处山洞和矿井。",
    ["Recover the 8 lost chapters of Draconic for Dummies and combine them with the Magical Book Binding and return the completed book of Draconic for Dummies: Volume II to Narain Soothfancy in Tanaris."] = "把8章《龙语傻瓜教程》的章节用魔法书封面合起来，然后把完整的《龙语傻瓜教程：第二卷》交给塔纳利斯的纳瑞安。",
    ["Recover the Sea Turtle Remains from the Skeletal Sea Turtle in the waters west of Auberdine, and then speak with Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde back in Auberdine."] = "在奥伯丁西面海水中的海龟骸骨那里取回海龟残骸，然后与奥伯丁的温尼斯·布莱葛谈一谈。",
    ["Report back what you have found to Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea in Auberdine."] = "向奥伯丁的哨兵哨兵戈琳达·纳希恩报告你的发现。",
    ["Report to King Magni Bronzebeard."] = "向铁炉堡的国王麦格尼·铜须汇报。",
    ["Report to Yorana Windyreed at the eastern watchtower in the Gustberry Lowlands."] = "向阵风浆果低地东部瞭望塔的尤拉娜·风苇报到。",
    ["Report your findings to First Mate Crazz in Booty Bay."] = "将你的发现报告给藏宝海湾的大副克拉兹。",
    ["Retrieve 4 Miners' Union Cards and return them to Wilder Thistlenettle in Stormwind."] = "给暴风城的维尔德·蓟草带回4张矿业工会会员卡。",
    ["Retrieve 7 Highborne Relics for Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine."] = "帮奥伯丁的桑迪斯·织风取回7个上层精灵的遗物。",
    ["Retrieve 8 Tumbled Crystals and return them to Kebok in Booty Bay."] = "给藏宝海湾的科博克带回8块打磨过的水晶。",
    ["Retrieve Deathguard Humbert's sword from Dun Garok and return it to him in Tarren Mill."] = "从丹加洛克拿回亡灵卫兵亨伯特的长剑，然后回到塔伦米尔把剑还给他。",
    ["Retrieve Haggard's Badge from Dead-tooth Jack's camp, and return to Marshal Haggard."] = "从蛀牙杰克的营地里取回治安官哈迦德的徽章，把它交给治安官哈迦德。",
    ["Retrieve Marez Cowl's Bloodstone Orb and bring it to Tor'gan in Hammerfall."] = "取回玛雷兹·考尔的血石宝珠，把它交给落锤村的托尔甘。",
    ["Retrieve Mythology of the Titans from the Monastery and bring it to Librarian Mae Paledust in Ironforge."] = "从修道院拿回《泰坦神话》，把它交给铁炉堡的图书馆员麦伊·苍尘。",
    ["Retrieve Tundra MacGrann's dried meats from the stolen meat locker in Old Icebeard's cave."] = "从冰须的洞穴里拿回装有马克格拉恩的干肉的储藏柜。",
    ["Retrieve a Fallen Moonstone from the Shadethicket Oracle, then bring it to Pelturas in Astranaar."] = "从沼泽兽智者那里取回一枚陨落的月亮石，并把它带给阿斯特兰纳的皮尔图拉斯·怀特姆恩。",
    ["Retrieve the Cloven Hoof for Rau Cliffrunner at the Freewind Post."] = "拿到裂开的蹄子，把它交给乱风岗的劳恩·峭壁行者。",
    ["Retrieve the Compendium of the Fallen from the Monastery in Tirisfal Glades and return to Sage Truthseeker in Thunder Bluff."] = "从血色修道院里找到《堕落者纲要》，把它交给雷霆崖的圣者图希克。",
    ["Retrieve the Gnoam Sprecklesprocket from the Deadmines and return it to Shoni the Shilent in Stormwind."] = "从死亡矿井中带回小型高能发动机，将其带给暴风城矮人区中的沉默的舒尼。",
    ["Retrieve the Relics of Wakening and bring them to Athridas Bearmantle in Dolanaar."] = "寻回四件唤醒圣物,把它们带给多兰纳尔的阿斯瑞达斯·熊皮。",
    ["Retrieve the Rig Blueprints and Thermaplugg's Safe Combination from Gnomeregan and bring them to Nogg in Orgrimmar."] = "从诺莫瑞根拿到钻探设备蓝图和麦克尼尔的保险箱密码，把它们交给奥格瑞玛的诺格。",
    ["Retrieve the Shipment of Boots and Telescopic Lens for Gazlowe in Ratchet."] = "帮棘齿城的加兹鲁维取回一箱靴子以及一块望远镜片。",
    ["Return 8 Smooth Boulders to Thra behind Grommash Hold."] = "找来8块光滑的巨石，交给格罗玛什要塞后面的斯拉。",
    ["Return the Modified Seaforium Booster to Razzeric on the Shimmering Flats."] = "将改进型爆盐增压器还给闪光平原的拉泽瑞克。",
    ["Return the Remains of Trey Lightforge to Jessir Moonbow in Felwood."] = "将特雷·莱弗治的残骸交给费伍德森林的杰希尔·月弓。",
    ["Return the Samophlange to Sputtervalve in Ratchet."] = "把主动式负载平衡器交给棘齿城的斯布特瓦夫。",
    ["Return the Sparkling Stone and the Stave of Equinex to Troyas Moonbreeze in Feathermoon Stronghold."] = "将闪光的石头和艾奎尼克斯法杖交给羽月要塞的特洛亚斯·月风。",
    ["Return to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar."] = "回到奥格瑞玛的贝尔戈洛姆·石槌那儿。",
    ["Return to Brother Kristoff in the Cathedral Square. Give him the book The Stresses of Iron."] = "回到教堂广场，将《金属的延展性》交给克里斯托弗修士。",
    ["Return to Kreldig Ungor in Desolace."] = "回到凄凉之地的克雷迪格·安戈尔那里。",
    ["Return to Mokvar in Orgimmar with a set of Dreadmist Sandals, Dreadmist Leggings and Dreadmist Mantle."] = "带上一双鬼雾便鞋、一条鬼雾护腿和一副鬼雾衬肩，回去向奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔复命。",
    ["Return to Thunder Bluff and show Turak Runetotem the Pendant of the Sea Lion."] = "回到雷霆崖，让图拉克·符文图腾看看你的海狮坠饰。",
    ["Return to Thyn'tel Bladeweaver in Darnassus."] = "回到达纳苏斯去见珊蒂斯·羽月。",
    ["Return to the Scholomance with the Blood of Innocents. Find the porch and place the Blood of Innocents in the brazier. Kirtonos will come to feast upon your soul.Fight valiantly, do not give an inch! Destroy Kirtonos and return to Eva Sarkhoff."] = "带着无辜者之血回到通灵学院，将它放在门廊的火盆下面，基尔图诺斯会前来吞噬你的灵魂。  勇敢地战斗吧，不要退缩！杀死基尔图诺斯，然后回到艾瓦·萨克霍夫那儿。",
    ["Rhag Garmason wants you to locate Ol' Rustlocke."] = "拉格·加玛森要求你找到老伊本瑟。",
    ["Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Boots if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1双被玷污的长靴、12块锁甲碎片、1块奥金锭和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的雷布拉特·碎地者，他将为你制作一双碎地者长靴。",
    ["Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Handguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1双被玷污的护手、8块锁甲碎片、1块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的雷布拉特·碎地者，他将为你制作一双碎地者护手。",
    ["Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Legguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Legguards, 20 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 3 Arcanite Bars and 5 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的腿甲、20块锁甲碎片、3块奥金锭和5个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的雷布拉特·碎地者，他将为你制作一副碎地者腿甲。",
    ["Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Spaulders if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Spaulders, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 2 Arcanite Bars and 2 Mooncloth."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的肩饰、12块锁甲碎片、2块奥金锭和2张月布交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的雷布拉特·碎地者，他将为你制作一副碎地者肩饰。",
    ["Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Earthshatter Wristguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 2 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1副被玷污的护腕、6块锁甲碎片、1块奥金锭和2个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的雷布拉特·碎地者，他将为你制作一副碎地者护腕。",
    ["Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make an Earthshatter Girdle if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1条被玷污的束带、8块锁甲碎片、1块奥金锭和3块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的雷布拉特·碎地者，他将为你制作一条碎地者束带。",
    ["Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make an Earthshatter Headpiece if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals."] = "如果你将1件被玷污的头饰、15块锁甲碎片、4块奥金锭和2块连结水晶交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的雷布拉特·碎地者，他将为你制作一件碎地者头饰。",
    ["Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make an Earthshatter Tunic if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Tunic, 25 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 3 Cured Rugged Hides."] = "如果你将1件被玷污的外套、25块锁甲碎片、4块奥金锭和3个熟化毛皮交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的雷布拉特·碎地者，他将为你制作一件碎地者外套。",
    ["Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Bonescythe Sabatons if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Sabatons, 12 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 3 Cured Rugged Hides, 2 Nexus Crystals and 25 gold pieces."] = "如果你将1双被玷污的马靴、12块皮甲碎片、3个熟化毛皮、2块连结水晶和25金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的杀手洛汗，他会为你制作一双骨镰马靴。",
    ["Rohan the Assassin at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Bonescythe Waistguard if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Waistguard, 8 Wartorn Leather Scraps, 5 Cured Rugged Hides, 1 Nexus Crystal and 15 gold pieces."] = "如果你将1条被玷污的护腰、8块皮甲碎片、5个熟化毛皮、1块连结水晶和15金币交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的杀手洛汗，他会为你制作一条骨镰护腰。",
    ["Rudra Amberstill wants you to slay Vagash and bring his fang to her at the Ram ranch."] = "山羊农场的鲁德拉·冻石要你杀了瓦加什，并且把它的牙齿给她带回去。",
    ["Safely escort Gilthares Firebough back to Captain Brightsun in Ratchet."] = "护送基尔萨瑞斯·火枝安全地返回棘齿城的沙罗萨斯船长那里。",
    ["Salfa wants you to kill 8 Winterfall Shaman, 8 Winterfall Den Watchers, and 8 Winterfall Ursa. Salfa is located just outside the entrance to Timbermaw Hold in Winterspring."] = "萨尔法要你去杀死8个冬泉萨满祭司、8个冬泉巢穴守卫和8个冬泉巨熊怪。萨尔法就站在冬泉谷的木喉要塞入口处。",
    ["Salma Saldean wants 3 Stringy Vulture Meat, 3 Goretusk Snouts, 3 Murloc Eyes, 3 Okra."] = "萨尔玛·萨丁需要3块秃鹫肉条、3只血牙野猪的头、3颗鱼人的眼睛和3棵秋葵。",
    ["Scout Riell at the Sentinel Hill Tower wants you to bring her 10 Red Silk Bandanas."] = "给哨兵岭哨塔的哨兵瑞尔带回10条红色丝质面罩。",
    ["Search Deathknell and the vicinity for 6 pieces of Scavenged Goods, and return them to Deathguard Saltain."] = "在丧钟镇及临近地区搜寻6件破烂装备，把它们交给亡灵卫兵萨尔坦。",
    ["Search Shatter Scar Vale in Felwood for the remains of Kroshius. When you locate the remains, use the Fel Fire near them and await Kroshius' return. When the infernal has awoken, slay him and take from his corpse Kroshius' Infernal Core.Return Kroshius' Infernal Core to Niby the Almighty in Felwood."] = "在费伍德森林的碎痕谷中搜寻克罗苏斯的尸体。当你找到尸体后，在他身上使用魔火，并等待克罗苏斯复生。当这个地狱火被唤醒之后，干掉他，从他的身上拿取克罗苏斯的恶魔之核。  把克罗苏斯的恶魔之核交给费伍德森林的尼比。",
    ["Security Chief Bilgewhizzle of Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris wants you to kill 10 Southsea Pirates, 10 Southsea Freebooters, 10 Southsea Dock Workers and 10 Southsea Swashbucklers."] = "塔纳利斯热砂港的安全主管吉罗姆·比格维兹要你去干掉10个南海海盗、10个南海劫掠者、10个南海码头工人和10个南海流氓。",
    ["Seek audience with High Chieftain Cairne Bloodhoof in Thunder Bluff."] = "前往雷霆崖求见大酋长凯恩·血蹄。",
    ["Set the North, South, East, and West Sentry Towers on fire by using the Torch of Retribution inside each of the buildings."] = "使用惩戒火炬点燃北部、南部、东部和西部的哨塔。",
    ["Shadow Priest Sarvis wants you to kill 8 Mindless Zombies and 8 Wretched Zombies."] = "暗影牧师萨维斯让你杀掉8个无脑的僵尸和8个丑陋的僵尸。",
    ["Show Tooga the way back to his wife, Torta."] = "把图加带回到他的妻子托尔塔身边。",
    ["Sir S. J. Erlgadin of Nesingwary's Expedition wants you to bring him the Fang of Bhag'thera."] = "奈辛瓦里远征队的埃尔加丁爵士要求你杀死巴尔瑟拉，并带回它的牙。",
    ["Slay 15 Crushridge Warmongers, then return to Marshal Redpath in Southshore."] = "杀死15个破碎岭好战者，然后回南海镇向治安官雷德帕斯报告。",
    ["Slay 6 Windshaper Novice Seers in Shen'dar Highlands."] = "在申达尔高地消灭6名塑风者见习先知。",
    ["Slay 8 Ursera Scavengers and collect the head of the den mother, Urs'anah in Thendal Grove."] = "在森达尔林地消灭8只乌萨拉食腐者，并收集兽穴之母乌萨娜的徽记。",
    ["Slay 8 Vile Fin Attackers and 8 Vile Fin Seers and report back to Breton Samuels when it is done."] = "消灭8名邪鳍攻击者和8名邪鳍先知，完成后向布雷顿·萨缪尔斯复命。",
    ["Slay 8 Vuldren Juveniles in Thendal Grove."] = "在森达尔林地消灭8只幼年瓦尔德伦。",
    ["Slay Agmond's killer, Murdaloc.Slay 12 Stonevault Bonesnappers.Report to Prospector Ironband in Loch Modan."] = "干掉杀害阿戈莫德的凶手：莫达洛克。  顺便杀掉12个石窟断骨者。  然后向洛克莫丹的勘察员基恩萨·铁环报告。",
    ["Slay Alliance soldiers encroaching into the Barrens at the border to Dustwallow Marsh, then return to Grunt Logmar at Camp Taurajo."] = "消灭在尘泥沼泽边境侵入贫瘠之地的联盟士兵，然后返回陶拉祖营地向步兵劳格玛复命。",
    ["Slay Arikara. Bring her remains and the Incendia powder to Motega Firemane in Whitereach Post as proof of your deed."] = "杀死阿利卡拉。把她的遗体和火岩粉交给白沙岗哨的莫特加·火鬃作为证明。",
    ["Slay Commander Belguilos in the Gustberry Lowlands."] = "在阵风浆果低地消灭指挥官贝尔吉洛斯。",
    ["Slay Frosthowl and collect the Sack of Fish for Gretta Ganter in Brewnall Village."] = "消灭霜嚎并收集一袋鲜鱼，交给烈酒村的格雷塔·甘特。",
    ["Slay Lathoric the Black and Obsidion, and return to Thorius in Ironforge with the Head of Lathoric the Black and the Heart of Obsidion."] = "杀死黑衣拉索里克和奥比斯顿，带着黑衣拉索里克的头颅和奥比斯顿的心脏回到铁炉堡的索里奥斯那儿。",
    ["Slay Lord Azrethoc and Jugkar Grim'rod and return to Takata Steelblade in Desolace."] = "杀掉魔王阿兹雷索克和祖格卡，然后向凄凉之地的塔卡塔·钢刃复命。",
    ["Slay Nefarian and recover the Red Scepter Shard. Return the Red Scepter Shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris. You have 5 hours to complete this task."] = "杀死奈法利安，并拿到红色节杖碎片。把红色节杖碎片交给塔纳利斯时光之穴入口处的阿纳克洛斯。你必须在5小时之内完成这个任务。",
    ["Slay Or'Kalar and bring his Head to Korin Fel in the Hammerfall outpost."] = "杀死奥卡拉尔，将他的头颅带给落锤村哨所的科林法尔。",
    ["Slay Princess Theradras and return to Selendra near Shadowprey Village in Desolace."] = "杀死瑟莱德丝公主，然后回到凄凉之地葬影村附近的瑟琳德拉那里复命。",
    ["Slay Serena Bloodfeather and return her head to Darsok Swiftdagger at the Crossroads."] = "杀掉塞瑞娜·血羽，把她的头颅交给十字路口的达索克·快刀。",
    ["Slay Trade Master Kovic and his minion Clunk. Retrieve the Trader's Satchel from his corpse and return it to Nilith."] = "杀了贸易首领考维克和他的同伙科朗克。从他的尸体上拿回商人的背包，把它交给尼莉丝。",
    ["Slay the beast and bring back the Hypercapacitor Gizmo and Panther Cage Key to Wizlo Bearingshiner."] = "杀了那头野兽，把超适应齿轮和钥匙交给维兹罗。",
    ["Slay the gnoll Hogger and bring his Huge Gnoll Claw to Marshal Dughan."] = "杀死豺狼人霍格，把他那巨大的豺狼人爪带给治安官杜汉。",
    ["Speak to Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar."] = "与奥格瑞玛的贝尔戈洛姆·石槌谈一谈。",
    ["Speak to Keldran in Orgrimmar."] = "与奥格瑞玛的科尔丹谈一谈。",
    ["Speak to Mikhail in the Wetlands."] = "与湿地的米克哈尔谈一谈。",
    ["Speak with Acolyte Dellis in Stormwind."] = "与暴风城里的助手迪利斯谈一谈。",
    ["Speak with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus."] = "与达纳苏斯的大德鲁伊范达尔·鹿盔谈一谈。",
    ["Speak with Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post after seeing Feero safely through Ashenvale Forest."] = "护送费罗·艾隆汉安全地穿越灰谷森林，然后和迈斯特拉岗哨的净化者德尔格伦谈一谈。",
    ["Speak with Fizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats."] = "和闪光平原的菲兹尔·铜栓谈一谈。",
    ["Speak with Lieutenant Doren."] = "与多伦上尉谈一谈。",
    ["Speak with Mura Runetotem in the Sepulcher."] = "和瑟伯切尔的茉拉·符文图腾谈一谈。",
    ["Speak with Overlord Mok'Morokk in Brackenwall Village."] = "和蕨墙村的莫格穆洛克大王谈一谈。",
    ["Speak with Rabine Saturna in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade."] = "与月光林地永夜港的拉比恩·萨图纳谈一谈。",
    ["Speak with Shandris Feathermoon in Feathermoon Stronghold."] = "与羽月要塞的珊蒂斯·羽月谈一谈。",
    ["Speak with Zggi, the servant of Zardeth the Blackclaw, to claim your reward."] = "去找黑爪加尔德斯的仆人兹吉谈一谈，并向他索要你的酬劳。",
    ["Sten Stoutarm would like 8 pieces of Tough Wolf Meat."] = "斯登·粗臂想要8块硬狼肉。",
    ["Storm Shadowhoof at Everlook in Winterspring wants you to defeat Shy-Rotam."] = "永望镇的斯托姆·影蹄想要你去杀死希洛塔姆。",
    ["String 5 Channeler's Heads, then return the Collection of Troll Heads to Exzhal on Yojamba Isle."] = "将神圣之索穿上5颗导魔师的头颅，然后把这一串头颅交给尤亚姆巴岛上的伊克萨尔。",
    ["Sulhasa in southern Barrens wants you to clear out 7 Stormhide lizards and 7 Hecklefang Stalkers in the area so she can leave the tree safely."] = "贫瘠之地南部的苏尔哈萨需要你清理该区域内的7只雷鳞蜥蜴与7名乱齿捕猎者，以确保她能安全地离开大树。",
    ["Take Brann Bronzebeard's Letter to Bronzebeard's Encampment in southern Silithus."] = "将布莱恩·铜须的信件带往希利苏斯南部的铜须营地。",
    ["Take Darthalia's Sealed Commendation to Varimathras in the Undercity."] = "把达萨利亚的奖状交给幽暗城的瓦里玛萨斯。",
    ["Take Gor'tesh's Lopped Off Head and place it at the top of Dreadmaul Rock. Look for a soft dirt mound to plant the pike."] = "把戈泰什的头颅放在巨槌石的山顶上。找一块软土堆把串着头颅的长矛插上去就可以了。",
    ["Take Jer'kai's Signet Ring to High Priestess Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus."] = "将耶尔卡的徽记之戒交给达纳苏斯的高阶女祭司泰兰德·语风。",
    ["Take Marshal McBride's Documents to Marshal Dughan in Goldshire."] = "将治安官玛克布莱德的文件带给闪金镇的治安官杜汉。",
    ["Take Sarah Ladimore's ring to Morgan Ladimore's grave."] = "把莎拉·拉迪莫尔的戒指拿到摩根·拉迪莫尔的坟墓上去。",
    ["Take the Blue-feathered Necklace to Nara Wildmane."] = "把蓝羽项链交给纳拉·蛮鬃。",
    ["Take the Eye of C'Thun to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time."] = "把克苏恩之眼交给时光之穴的阿纳克洛斯。",
    ["Take the Grimtotem Satchel to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff."] = "将恐怖图腾背包交给雷霆崖的拉哈罗。",
    ["Take the Sealed Letter to Archmage Malin in the Mage Quarter of Stormwind."] = "将给大法师马林的信交给暴风城法师区里的大法师马林。",
    ["Take the Small Scroll to Varimathras in the Undercity."] = "把小卷轴交给幽暗城的瓦里玛萨斯。",
    ["Take the Woven Wand to Bethor Iceshard in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity."] = "将狼人魔杖带给幽暗城法师区的比索·埃斯沙德。",
    ["Take the copy of Goodsteel's Ledger and then find the items listed in it before seeking Krinkle Goodsteel in Tanaris."] = "把古德斯迪尔的账本和上面所列的物品交给塔纳利斯的克林科·古德斯迪尔。",
    ["Talin Keeneye would like you to kill 12 Small Crag Boars."] = "塔林·锐眼让你去杀掉12只小型峭壁野猪。",
    ["Talk to Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post."] = "和迈斯特拉岗哨的净化者德尔格伦谈一谈。",
    ["Talo Thornhoof in Camp Mojache wants Edana Hatetalon's Dark Heart."] = "莫沙彻营地的塔罗·刺蹄要你给他拿去艾丹娜·邪爪的黑心。",
    ["Tharg in Brackenwall Village wants you to kill 15 Firemane Scouts, 10 Firemane Ash Tails, and 5 Firemane Guards."] = "蕨墙村的萨尔格要你去杀掉15个火鬃斥候，10个火鬃灰尾龙人和5个火鬃守卫。",
    ["The Disarming Mixture seemed to take effect.  Return to Chief Engineer Hinderweir to report the good news."] = "拆弹剂看来已经产生了效果。你可以回去向主工程师辛德维尔七世汇报这个好消息了。",
    ["The Scarlet Crusade is on the move. Somewhere along the road from Tyr's Hand to Stratholme you will find the Oracle, Demetria, and her entourage. Hunt her down and slay her. Return to Nathanos Blightcaller should you succeed."] = "血色十字军正在从提尔之手到斯坦索姆的路上巡逻，你可以在巡逻队中找到圣者德米提雅和她的随从，找到并杀死她。如果你成功了，就回到纳萨诺斯·凋零者那里去复命。",
    ["Travel to Falfindel Waywarder on the border of Thousand Needles and Feralas."] = "在千针石林与菲拉斯的边境上找到法芬德尔。",
    ["Travel to Fire Plume Ridge, south of Marshal's Refuge.Find Blazerunner and use the totem to remove his protective aura. Once he has been defeated, acquire the Golden Flame from the cave."] = "到马绍尔营地南边的火羽山去。  找到火焰使者，并使用图腾除掉它的防护光环。在击败它之后从洞中取得金色火焰。",
    ["Travel to Plaguewood, northwest of Light's Hope. Destroy 8 Scourge Structures by using Smokey's Special Compound at the Mark of Detonation planted inside each building. Smokey has had the Ziggurats and Slaughterhouses marked.Once you plant the bomb, leave the building and marvel at your handiwork.By the way, Smokey's Special Compound is rather... unstable."] = "到圣光之愿礼拜堂西北方的病木林去。在那些有爆炸标记的建筑物中对爆炸标记使用烟鬼的特殊混合物，以此来摧毁8座亡灵天灾建筑。烟鬼已经给通灵塔和屠宰房做上了标记。  一旦你放置好炸弹，就离那些建筑物远一些，然后尽情欣赏你的杰作吧。  顺便说一句，烟鬼的特殊混合物相当不稳定……",
    ["Travel to Stratholme, in the north. Search the supply crates that litter the city and recover 5 Stratholme Holy Water. Return to Leonid Barthalomew the Revered when you have collected enough of the blessed fluid."] = "到北方的斯坦索姆去，寻找散落在城市中的补给箱，并收集5瓶斯坦索姆圣水。当你找到足够的圣水之后就回去向莱尼德·巴萨罗梅复命。",
    ["Travel to the Den on Stonetalon Peak. Using the Gatekeeper's Key, obtain the druids' hidden items. Use these items to open the Talon Den Hoard."] = "到石爪峰上的洞穴中去，使用守门人的钥匙拿到能打开石爪峰顶的猛禽洞穴储藏室的物品。",
    ["Use Morbent's Bane on Morbent Fel, kill Morbent Fel, then return Morbent's Bane to Sven at his camp."] = "对摩本特·费尔使用摩本特的克星，杀掉他，然后把摩本特的克星交给斯温。",
    ["Use Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker to zap any kind of giant found in Feralas into a more manageable form. Bring 15 Miniaturization Residues found on the zapped versions of these giants to Zorbin Fandazzle at the docks of the Forgotten Coast, Feralas."] = "使用索尔宾的超级压缩器来缩小菲拉斯的任意种类的巨人，将他们缩小到更容易控制的体积。从缩小过的巨人身上收集15份微缩残渣，把它们交给菲拉斯被遗忘的海岸码头的索尔宾·范达瑟。",
    ["Use the Arcanite Buoy at the Swirling Maelstrom at the Bay of Storms in Azshara."] = "在艾萨拉风暴海湾一带的湍急的漩涡处使用奥金鱼漂。",
    ["Use the Curative Animal Salve on 10 Sickly Deer that are located throughout Darkshore; doing so should cure them. Sickly Deer have been reported starting south of the Cliffspring River to the north of Auberdine and extending all the way into southern Darkshore where the edge of Ashenvale begins."] = "对黑海岸的10头生病的鹿使用动物医疗药膏，以此来治疗它们。从壁泉河到奥伯丁，直到最南端靠近灰谷的地区都有生病的鹿出没。",
    ["Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance. Doing so will bring forth spirits you must fight. Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver; defeat him.Bring Darkreaver's Head to Sagorne Creststrider in the Valley of Wisdom, Orgrimmar."] = "在斯坦索姆地下室的尸骨储藏所的中心使用预言水晶球。然后你必须与被召唤出来的幽灵作战。击败这些幽灵之后，死亡骑士达克雷尔才会出现，你的任务就是击败他。  把死亡骑士达克雷尔的头颅交给奥格瑞玛智慧谷的萨格尼。",
    ["Use the Sign of the Earth to activate the Pillars of Amethyst, Opal, and Diamond and obtain the Runestones.Place the runestones in the Seal of the Earth to free Blacklash and Hematus.Slay them and return Blacklash's Bindings, the Chains of Hematus, and the Sign of the Earth to Garek."] = "用大地印章激活钻石柱、玛瑙石柱和紫水晶石柱并拿到三颗符石。  把符石放在大地封印上，释放黑龙布莱克拉什和赫玛图斯。  杀了这两条黑龙，把布莱克拉什的锁链、赫玛图斯的锁链和大地印章交给加瑞克。",
    ["Use the Small Brass Key to open Bookie Herod's Strongbox."] = "使用黄铜钥匙打开书呆子赫罗德的保险箱。",
    ["Use the Temporal Displacer near one of Andorhal's silos and uncover Temporal Parasites.Slay 15 Temporal Parasites, and then return the Temporal Displacer to Chromie in the Andorhal Inn, Western Plaguelands."] = "在安多哈尔的一处仓库附近使用时光置换器，使时光寄生虫现身。  杀掉15只时光寄生虫，然后将时光置换器还给西瘟疫之地安多哈尔旅店的克罗米。",
    ["Use the Thunderhorn Cleansing Totem at the Thunderhorn Water Well, then return to Mull."] = "在雷角之井使用雷角之井净化图腾，然后回来见穆尔。",
    ["Use the Wildmane Cleansing Totem at the Wildmane Water Well, then return to Mull Thunderhorn."] = "在蛮鬃之井使用蛮鬃之井净化图腾，然后回来见穆尔·雷角。",
    ["Using the contents of Torwa's Pouch, summon Lar'korwi and defeat him. Then bring Lar'korwi's Head to Torwa Pathfinder near the entrance to Un'Goro Crater."] = "使用托尔瓦的麻袋中的东西召唤拉克维并打败它。将拉克维的头颅交给安戈洛环形山入口处的托尔瓦·寻路者。",
    ["Venture to the Valley of Heroes in Stormwind City and speak with Field Marshal Afrasiabi."] = "回到暴风城的英雄谷，与艾法希比元帅谈一谈。",
    ["Wait for Galvan to finish forging the weaponry."] = "等待加尔文为你锻造武器。",
    ["Wait for Jordan Stilwell to finish forging a weapon for you."] = "等待乔丹·斯迪威尔为你铸造武器。",
    ["Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete the Orb of Dar'Orahil and then speak to her again."] = "等待梅纳拉·沃伦德完成达奥拉赫宝珠，然后再与她谈一谈。",
    ["Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete the Orb of Noh'Orahil and then speak to her again."] = "等待梅纳拉·沃伦德完成诺奥拉赫宝珠，然后再与她谈一谈。",
    ["Wait for Menara Voidrender to complete your robe and then speak to her again."] = "等待梅纳拉·沃伦德织好披风，然后跟她谈一谈。",
    ["Witch Doctor Jin'Zil at Malaka'jin wants 5 portions of Stonetalon Sap, 5 Twilight Whiskers, 30 Courser Eyes and a Fey Dragon Scale."] = "玛拉卡金的巫医金吉尔需要5瓶石爪苔液、5根夜行虎须、30颗巨角鹿的眼球和1块灵龙的鳞片。",
    ["Witch Doctor Uzer'i wants you to wait for a moment while he prepares the weapons."] = "巫医尤克里希望你在他准备武器的时候稍等一会儿。",
    ["You have been ordered to slay Vile Priestess Hexx and 20 Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guards. See Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands once this task is complete.Vile Priestess Hexx and the Aman'zasi Guards can be found atop Jintha'alor in the Hinterlands."] = "你必须杀掉邪恶祭司海克斯和20名邪枝精英守卫。任务完成之后回到辛特兰的恶齿村，向断齿族长报告。  你可以在辛特兰的邪枝巨魔城市辛萨罗的顶部找到他们。",
    ["You have been tasked with the decimation of 20 Vilebranch Berserkers, 20 Vilebranch Shadow Hunters, 20 Vilebranch Blood Drinkers, and 20 Vilebranch Soul Eaters.Should you complete this task, return to Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands."] = "你必须消灭20个邪枝狂战士、20个邪枝暗影猎手、20个邪枝饮血者和20个邪枝噬魂者。  完成任务之后向辛特兰恶齿村的断齿族长复命。",
}) do objectives[k] = v end
